<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">Yohans Bek'o</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohans Bek'o</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohans Bek'ts Bek'o</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bek'.</para>
  <para style="mt">Yohans Bek'ts Bek'o</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohans bek'ts bek'o b́guut'e krstiyaniwots Iyesus Krstosi bo doonzi b́wottsok'owo bo amantsatse tuutson gishewonat gond bek'on boats b́ bodo dúra b́tesh. Guut'tso b́t'iwintsir nababirwots bo jangirwo s'eeno b́ wotitwok'o kup'shr boats gishewonat gond bek'otse bo amantson bín bokashitwok'o bo ango kup'shosha.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mas'aafanitsi ay kaywots ay wotsnat shine shuuts waats bek'uwotsi detske, bek'manootswere man dúri teshts amantsuwots t'iwintso falitkno, k'oshwotsshmó ááshk wotar teshetk be'et arok'on t'intsek keewok'on t'intseknee. Duubi garo anaan b́ íwishefok'o mas'aafan tookwots k'osh k'osh naari bek'wots k'osh k'osh naari aron ananshdek't t'intsere. Mas'aafan b́ biitse biitsewonúwere k'osh k'osh naaron asaabiyo b́beetka wotiyaloŕ bítse een keewo daneeka, manwere Ik'o, doonzo Krstos weeron aani iwisherawok'o iknoto b́ jamon Shed'anono dabt b́balangar jamwotsi da'itwe, da'amanwere b́s'uwoor amanetswotsi wotts b́ jirwotssh handr daronat handr datsatsi deero boosh naatitwe.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1:1-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Bek'man tuwokonat Ik'i maa shawatwotssh wosheets wosho 1:9—3:22</para>
  <para style="io1">Mas'aaf mannat shawat matebwotsn 4:1—8:1</para>
  <para style="io1">Fugef shawat eezbedwotsi 8:2—11:19</para>
  <para style="io1">Darwonat s'oots gitwotsn 12:1—13:18</para>
  <para style="io1">K'osh k'osh bek'uwots 14:1—15:8</para>
  <para style="io1">Shawat Ik'i fayi wanc'uwotsi 16:1-21</para>
  <para style="io1">Babilon t'afo, Din s'ootso, kootets nebiyonat Diyablosn da'etsok'o 17:1—20:10</para>
  <para style="io1">S'uwaatsi angsho 20:11-15</para>
  <para style="io1">Dari handro, handr datsu, Iyerusalem handru 21:1—22:5</para>
  <para style="io1">B́ gúúpo 22:6-21</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1"/>Bek'an karn gizewotse wotit keewo Ik'o b́ guutswotssh kitsosh Iyesus Krstossh b́ imtsoniye, Iyesus Krstoswere melakiyo woshat b́ guutso Yohanissh bek'an b́ kitsi. <verse eid="REV 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2"/>Yohaniswere Ik' aap'onat Iyesus Krstos bísh b́ danitso, mank'o b́ bek'ts keew jamo gawere. <verse eid="REV 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3"/>Jaman b́s'eenet aawo karn b́ wottsotse bek'i aap'an nababirwo deereke! mank'o bek'i aap'man shishirwotsnat beek'anits guut'etso s'eentsitwots derekne.<verse eid="REV 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isiyotsi shawat Ik' mowotssh wosheets jamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="REV 1:4-5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4-5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:4">Isa. 55:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:27">Dub. 89:27</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:14">Kesh. 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:5">Bek'. 4:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Yohanisoke Isiyotse fa'a shawat Ik' moowwotssh. Fa'oke, teshtsoknat weetu Ik'oke, b́ naashi jori shinatse fa'a shawat shayirwotsoke, mank'o k'irotse tuwon k'aab wottsoke datsatsi nugúswotsi keewirwo, amanets gawo wottsoke, noon shuntsonat b́ s'atson nomorotse noon nas' kishtso Iyesus Krstos s'aatoonat jeenon itsh wotowe. <verse eid="REV 1:4-5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 19:6">Kesh. 19:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:10">Bek'. 5:10</ref> </char></note> Iyesus Krstos nihi Ik'osh kahniwotsi wotar no finish Mengst noon woshtsosh, Iyesus Krstossh mangonat angon dúre dúrosh b́ borfetso wotowe! amen.<verse eid="REV 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat. 24:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:26">Mar. 13:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:27">Luk'. 21:27</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:17">1 Tes. 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zek. 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:34">Yoh. 19:34</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:37">37</ref> </char>
    </note> Eshe daawnon weetwe, bín koshtswotsworu bo oreraniyere jametswots bín bek'etune, datsatsi ash naar jamo b́ jangosh eepetúne, keewanúwere aree, amen.<verse eid="REV 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="REV 22:13">Bek'. 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:14">Kesh. 3:14</ref> </char>
    </note> Fa'o, teshtso, weetwonwere, jam falts Ik'o doonzo «Alfonat Omegon,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Alfonat Omoegona: </char><char style="ft">Eto shintsonat s'uwaatsi Grik fideliwotsiye, </char></note> taane!» etfe.<verse eid="REV 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstos bek'on b́ be'etsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9"/>Iyesus Krstosn wotat gond bek'onat b́ menegsto, mank'o b́ k'amo itnton kaytso taa it eshú Yohanis Ik' aap'onat Iyesus gawi jangosh tipeyat Fet'moyi eteyiru aatso bin guurdek'ts datswatse tteshi, <verse eid="REV 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10"/>Doonzo aawots Shayirotse t befere gaati k'aarok'o een k'ááro t shuuts weeron hank'o bí eree t shishi, <verse eid="REV 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11"/>«N bek'irwo mas'aafats guud'de'er shawat Ik' moowwots maants etonwere Efeson maants, Semrnes maants, T'ergamon maants, Tyat'ros maants, Serdes maants, Filadelfiyo maants, Lodok'iyo maantswere woshowe.»<verse eid="REV 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12"/>Kon taash keewtsok'o danosh t shuutso maants wongr tieti, wongr tiettsok'onowere shawat c'eesho kuriru awntson doozetswotsi t bek'i, <verse eid="REV 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:5">10:5</ref> </char></note> C'eeshi bewoki talotsnowere ash na'a artso tbek'i, bíwere b́ tufok b́ borfetso geenz taho tahdek't, b́ gerats awntsi edo eddek'ke b́ teshi. <verse eid="REV 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14-15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan. 7:9</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:6">10:6</ref> </char></note> B́ tookonat b́ took s'iron shetsonat sufiyok'o nas'a b́ teshi, bí ááwwotswere taw at'ok'one bo teshi, <verse eid="REV 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 1:24">Hzk'. 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 43:2">43:2</ref> </char></note> b́ tufuwotswere taw k'ak'otse wos'wutsts k'aazok'o arkno bo teshi, b́ k'aaronúwere een aats fuundi k'aarok'owiye b́ teshi, <verse eid="REV 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16"/>B́ k'ani kishon shawat k'eenwotsi detsdek'tni b́ teshi, git weeron shash wotts shiki gorado b́ nonotse b́ keshfere b́ teshi, b́ shiits jami sháánonwere aaw taali aaw sháánok'oyiye b́ teshi. <verse eid="REV 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">Isa. 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:8">Bek'. 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref> </char></note> Bín t bek'tsok'on k'irts ashok'o wotat b́ tufi shirots dih tuutsi, bímó b́ k'ani kisho tiyats gedt hank'o b́'eti, «Shatk'aye, shintsonat s'uwaatstson taane, <verse eid="REV 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18"/>Taa beyar beetk taane, k'iratniye tteshi, ernmó hambe dúre dúrosh beyar beetk taane, k'ironat Si'oli k'eshit k'ulfiwotsi detsfe. <verse eid="REV 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19"/>Eshe nbek'tso and fa'onat shuutsomaand wetwon guud'e. <verse eid="REV 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20"/>T k'ani kishatse nbek'iru shawat k'enwotsnat shawat awntson dozets c'eesho biyats gedetwots ááshts keewo haniye, shawat k'eenwots shawat Ik' moowwots atsi, Ik'i melakiwotsiye, shawat c'eesh boats gedetswotsu shawat Ik' moowwtsiye.»<verse eid="REV 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2"/>
  <para style="s">(1) Efesonits Ik' moo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1"/>Efesonits Ik' maa melakiyosh, «Shawat k'eenwotsi b́ k'ani kishots detsdek'tso, shawat c'eesh kurefwots dagotse ananiruwo, <verse eid="REV 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2"/>n fino, kúp'at nfiintsok'o, n k'amo danfee, gondwotsnomó k'amo n maawtsok'o, woshetswotsi bowoterawo ‹wosheetsots noone› etirwotsi maramarat kootetsi bowoto n daatstsok'o danfee. <verse eid="REV 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3"/>K'amoon nkup'tsok'ont t shútsosh n taahraniyere gondo n bek'tsok'ono danfee, <verse eid="REV 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4"/>Ernmó ik keewo niyatsere t shit'tso detsfe, bíwere n shun shintso k'azk'rerne, <verse eid="REV 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5"/>awuk'o een beyoke n dihitsok'o gawde'e! naandre eree! shin finat nteshtsok'o andoru mank'o finowe, jaman k'alo n k'azalomó niyok weetwe, naandere eto n k'azal, n c'eeshi beyoko b́ beyoke k'a'úbazetwe. <verse eid="REV 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6"/>Ernmó neen t udit ik keewo fa'e, taa t shit'iru Nik'olawiyots fino neewere shit'rne.<verse eid="REV 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:9">Aze. 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:2">Bek'. 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:13">Hzk'. 28:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:8">31:8</ref> </char>
    </note> «Shayiro Ik' mooshwwotssh bí etirwo waaz detstso k'ewe! Da'a dek'etwo Ik' Genetotse fa'a kash mitatse b́ meetwok'o woshitwe.» etfe err guud'e.<verse eid="REV 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">(2) Semernesits Ik' moo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:6">Isa. 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Bek'. 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Semrnes Ik' maa melakiyosh, «Shintsonat s'watsts wottso, k'irt teshtsonat beyat beyirwo, <verse eid="REV 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9"/>n gond bek'onat n tugron danfee, wotowa eree gaaletsk neene, ayhudi bowoterawo ayhudi noone etiru, Shed'ani mabari wottswots, n shúútso bo t'afitsok'o danfee, <verse eid="REV 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10"/>shino maants niyats bodet gondbek'osh shatk'aye, eshe it fadetwok'o ititsere ik ikuwotsi Diyablos tipi moots gedetwe, tats aawosh gond bek'o daatsitute, n k'irfetsosh amanetso wotowe, kash akliliyo neesh imetwe.<verse eid="REV 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="REV 20:14">Bek'. 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:18">21:18</ref> </char>
    </note> «Shayiro Ik' moowwotssh b́ etirwo waaz detstso shiye! Da'adek'etwo gitl k'irosh eegor woteratse.» etfe err guud'e.<verse eid="REV 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">(3) P'ergamon Ik' moo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12"/>P'ergamon Ik' maa melakiyosh, «Git weeron shash detsts shiki gorad detsdek'tso, <verse eid="REV 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13"/>nee Shed'ani naashi jori beyoke n beyirwok'o danfee, wotowa eree t shútso kúp'idek'at detsrne, taash amanets gaw wottso Antip'asi Shed'ani beyirwoke it kitotse úd'ewor dab tiyatse ndetsts imnetiyo haleratsne. <verse eid="REV 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 22:5">Taaw. 22:5</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 22:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 31:16">31:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:4">Iwi. 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 25:1-3">Taaw. 25:1-3</ref> </char></note> Ernmó niatse tshit'ts múk' keewwotsi detsfe, manúwere Bel'am dants dano detsdek'ts ik ik ashuwots it dagotse fa'ane, Bela'mhan Isra'el ash ashuwots woteraw ik'uwotssh shukeets móó máár widetsi fino finar bodihitwok'o Balak'i iztsoniye. <verse eid="REV 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15"/>Mank'owere Nik'olots jírwots dano detsts ashuwotswere ititse fa'ane, <verse eid="REV 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16"/>Mansh naandre eree, man nk'azal káári niyok waar tnoni shikonowere boon kaaritwe.<verse eid="REV 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 16:14-15">Kesh. 16:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:33-34">16:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:48-50">Yoh. 6:48-50</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:2">Isa. 62:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:15">65:15</ref> </char>
    </note> «Shayro Ik'i moowwotssh bíetirwo waaz detstso shiye! da'adek'etwosh ááshts mano bísh imetuwe, handr shúútso bítse guut'ets shúts nas'unowere<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Shúts nas'a: </char><char style="ft">Griki nemotse shúts nas'o eto bín s'amiyets asho angshirwotsok b́ t'inor bín s'amiyets keewotse nas'o wotor bísh imef shúts nas'uni. </char></note> bísh imetwe, deek'etwoniyere okoon k'osho konwor man danatse.» etfe err guud'e.<verse eid="REV 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">(4) Tiyat'ronitsi Ik'i moowu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18"/>Tiyat'ron Ik' moowtsi melakiyosh, «Taw lalu arts ááwwotsi detstso taw k'ak'on wos'ts k'áázok'o arts tufuwotsi detsts Ik' na'o, <verse eid="REV 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19"/>n finonat nshunon, n imnetiyonat n finon, k'amoon n kúp'onowere danfee, ili n fino shintsoniyere b́ bogtsok'o danfee. <verse eid="REV 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 16:31">1 Naash. 16:31</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:22-30">2 Naash. 9:22-30</ref> </char></note> Ernmó niyatse tshit'ts keew iko detsfe, manwere ‹Nebiyi taane› etiru máátsu Elzabeli s'ik etaat k'azk'rerne, biwere t guutswots bo gusiyitwok'onat woteraw ik'uwotssh wosheets misho bo meetwok'o daniyon sheelirane. <verse eid="REV 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21"/>Naandre bi etetwok'o bish gizewo imre b́ teshi bimó b widatsere naandre err aano geratsane. <verse eid="REV 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22"/>Mansh kúúni es'ats bin dikitwe, binton bofints gond finatse aanar naandrone eto bok'azal binton wido finiru jamwotsats een kúúno dowetwe, <verse eid="REV 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23"/>b nanaúwotsno k'iron fayitwe, Ik' maa jamwotswere ash hasabiyonat tewnon p'ec'ar danetwo taa twottsok'o danetúne, it ik ikoshowere it finok'o imetwe.<verse eid="REV 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24"/>«Tiyat'rosn fa'a danan de'aniyere oorts jamwotssh, mank'owere ik ikwots Shed'ani ayidek't ááshts keewe bo etirwi shuutso sha'eraniye oortswotssh k'osh kuro itats kuriratse, <verse eid="REV 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25"/>b́ wotefere taa twafetsosh it detstso kup'shde'er deshde'ere. <verse eid="REV 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26"/>Da'adek'etwosh t fino finefetsr b́ s'uwaats b́borfetso kup'itwosh ay ash naaratse bí alituwok'o woshitwe, <verse eid="REV 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27"/>Bri gúmbonowere boon keewitwe, shali k'ac'ok'owere boon k'ic'de'er k'arintsitwe, alanwere taa t nihoke tdek'tsi naarok'oyiye, <verse eid="REV 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28"/>Dats gatsi k'enonowere bísh imetwe.<verse eid="REV 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29"/>«Shayiro Ik' moowwotssh bíetirwo waaz detstso shiye!» etfe err guud'e.<verse eid="REV 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3"/>
  <para style="s">(5) Serdesitsi Ik' moowu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1"/>Serdesitsi Ik' mootsi melakiyosh, «Shawat Ik' shayrwotsnat shawat k'eenwotsi detsdek'tso, n fino danfee, shúútsosh kashetsknene, ernmó k'irwtserne. <verse eid="REV 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2"/>Eshe tuuwe, k'irosh t'intsonat oorts n ang múkna'amani aani kup'shde'e, ti Ik'o Izar Izewer shinatse n fino s'eenk wotat bíere daatsratse. <verse eid="REV 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24:43-44">Mat. 24:43-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39-40">Luk'. 12:39-40</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:15">Bek'. 16:15</ref> </char></note> Eshe eegi naari dano ndek'tsok'owonat nshishtsok'o gawde'e, bíno korde'e, naandre eree, tuwo nk'azalmó úmp'etsok'o danerawon niats weetwe, awuri sa'aton twetwok'o danatsne. <verse eid="REV 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4"/>Ernmó botaho kimshrawwots Serdesitse k'atswots neenton fa'ane, bo nas' taho tahdek'o boosh b́geyitsotse nas' taho tahde'er taanton ametúne. <verse eid="REV 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 32:32-33">Kesh. 32:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:28">Dub. 69:28</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:12">Bek'. 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:32">Mat. 10:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:8">Luk'. 12:8</ref> </char></note> Da'adek'etwo bokok'o nas' taho tahdek'etwe, b́ shúútsono tnihnat melaki shinatse danitwe, kashetswots shúútso bíyats guut'et kashi mas'aafotse t'afibayatse.<verse eid="REV 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6"/>«Shayiro Ik'i moowwotssh bíetirwo waaz detstso shiye!» etfe err guud'e.<verse eid="REV 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">(6) Filedelfiyits Ik'i moow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 22:22">Isa. 22:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:14">Iyo. 12:14</ref> </char>
    </note> Filedelfiy Ik'i mootsi melakiyosh, «S'ayinonat arik wottso, Dawit k'ulfiyo detsdek'tso, bí b́ k'eshitwo konwor ic'atse. Bí b́is'etwo konwor k'eshratse. <verse eid="REV 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 49:23">Isa. 49:23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:14">60:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:4">43:4</ref> </char></note> Nfiino danfee, eshe hamb, konuwor is'osh b́falrawo k'eshets fengesho nshinaats gedk'rere, niangú múk'na'a b́wottsok'owo danfee, ernmó tiaap'tso kotdek'rne, tshútsonowere haleratsne. <verse eid="REV 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9"/>Eshe haniyak, Ayhudi bowoterawon Ayhudi noone etiru kootets Shed'ani mabariwots waar ntufishirots bodihitwok'o woshitwe, taa neen tshuntsok'onowere bodanetwok'o k'alitwe. <verse eid="REV 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10"/>K'amdek'tso wotowe tietts aap'o nkottsotse taawere datsatse beyirwotsi fadosh dats jamats weet gond bek'i sa'ator neen kotetwe. <verse eid="REV 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11"/>Eshe káári weetwe, ni akliliyo konwor niyatse k'aa'úb́de'awok'o ndetstso kup'shde deshde'e. <verse eid="REV 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 21:2">Bek'. 21:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:2">Isa. 62:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:15">65:15</ref> </char></note> Da'adek'tso ti Ik'o Izar Izewer mootse íro woshitwe, manoknowere b́ jamon keyatse, Ik'o Izar Izewer shúútsonat Izar Izewer kitu shúútsonowere bíyats guut'etuwe, kitmanwere darotse Izar Izeweroke oot'etu handru Iyerusalemiye, t shútsi handronowere bíyats guut'etwe.<verse eid="REV 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13"/>«Shayiro Ik' moowwots sh bí etirwo waaz detstso shiye!» etfe err guud'e.<verse eid="REV 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">(7) Lodok'itsi Ik' moowu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JDG 8:22">Mes. 8:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Lodok'i Ik' mootsi melakiyosh, «Ameni wottso, amanetsonat ari gaw wottso, azeets jami t'úúp' wotts Ik'oke keeweke, <verse eid="REV 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15"/>n fino danfee, ak'o wee k'ees'o woteratsne, ak'o wee k'ees'o n wotink'ere sheenge b́ teshi! <verse eid="REV 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16"/>Ak'o wee k'ees'o nwoteraniyere fuun etk n wottsotse t nonotse neen kishde'e s'udishe, <verse eid="REV 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17"/>‹Taa gaaletsk taane, ay gizo detsfe, taash shaptso eegoru aaliye› etirune, ernmó ashe dash, darts, tugrets, dogonat araatstso n wottsok'o danatsne, <verse eid="REV 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18"/>gaalets wotosh tawon fadeets awntso tiyatse n keewitwok'o, ni aratsono áátsosh nas' taho kewde'e, bek'o n falitwok'o ááw ato keewde'er n furitwok'o neen izituwe, <verse eid="REV 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:12">Ari. 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:6">Ibr. 12:6</ref> </char></note> taa t shunts jamo haditwe, sezitwe, mansh kúp'owe, naandre eree, <verse eid="REV 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20"/>Hamb! taa fengshats need'dek'at fengsho k'ofiirwe, konworu t k'ááro shiyir fengsho taash b́ k'eshiyal bíts kindr tohar meetwe, bíwere taanton meetwe, <verse eid="REV 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21"/>Taa da'adek'at t nihnton b́bee jooratse tbeyirwok'o mank'o da'adek'etwo taanton tbejooratse b́ beetwok'o woshitwe.<verse eid="REV 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22"/>«Shayiro Ik'i moowwotssh bíetirwo waaz detstso shiye!» etfe err guud'e.<verse eid="REV 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ik'i naashi jooronat Darotsi Ik' k'oni Tero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1"/>Haniyere il ts'iili, mannwe darotse k'eshets fengesho fa'e b́teshi, shin shishat t teshts gaati k'áárok'o k'ááro hank'o bíeti, «Hakan keer wowe, haniyak woto boosh geyit keewwotsi neesh kitsitwe,» <verse eid="REV 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2"/>manóór shayirots wottdek'i, darotse naashi jooro t bek'i, naashi joratsowere ash iko bedek'tni b́ teshi. <verse eid="REV 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2-3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 1:26-28">Hzk'. 1:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:1">10:1</ref> </char></note> Naashi jooratse beyiruman aronwere iyasep'diyonat serdesi b́k'awnts shaaw shúts arke b́ teshi, naashi jorman gúúronwere mergdiya eteets b́ k'awnts shaaw shúts arts Ik' edjoko fa'e b́ teshi, <verse eid="REV 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4"/>mank'o naashi jorman gúúratse hiye awd naashi jorwots fa'ano bo teshi, naashi joratsowere nas' taho tahadek'tswotsnat botokats awntsi akliliyo gúúfdek'ts hiye awd eenashwots bedek'tni bo tesh. <verse eid="REV 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 19:16">Kesh. 19:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 8:5">Bek'. 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">11:19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:8">16:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 1:13">Hzk'. 1:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:4">Bek'. 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:2">Zek. 4:2</ref> </char></note> Naashi jormanatsnowere awshi p'alk'o, guumonat guumi k'aarwotsk'o guumirwots bo keshfera bo teshi, naashi jorman shinatsnowere aat'iru shawat c'eshwots fa'ano bo tesh, boowere shawat Ik' shayirwotsi. <verse eid="REV 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6"/>Naashi jorman shinatsno ayidek't s'ayin mestayiti k'aro fa'e b́ teshi, taalotse, naashi jorman gúúratse, shinonat shútsnowere ay ááwwotsi detsts kashets azeets awdwots fa'ano boteshi. <verse eid="REV 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6-7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 5:10">5:10</ref> </char></note> Shints kashets azeetso eesh arika b́teshi, gitelo minz beera bíar, keezelo ash shiits arts shiitso detsfe b́ teshi, awdlo bidiru aakaa arka b́ teshi. <verse eid="REV 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 1:18">Hzk'. 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:12">10:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:2-3">Isa. 6:2-3</ref> </char></note> Awd kashets azetswotswere bo ik ikets shirt bango detsfno bo teshi, bo gúúronat bobangi shirootse ááwo s'eenwtska, t'úwonat aawon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">«S'ayinono! S'ayinono! S'ayinono!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">jam falts doonzo Izar Izewero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">teshtso fa'onat weetwonwere»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 4:8">eto need'irakno botesh. <verse eid="REV 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9"/>Kashets azeetsmanotswere naashi jooratse beyirwonat dúre dúro b́ borfetso beyirwosh shúúts een woto, mangonat udon bot'intsor, <verse eid="REV 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10"/>hiye awd eenashúwots dúre dúrosh b́ borfetso beyiru naashi jooratse beyirwo shinats bobaron gúp'gúp'dek't bosagadiri, bo akliliyotsnowere b́ jori shinats gedk'rat hank'o bo etiri,<verse eid="REV 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11"/>«No doonznat no Ik'o Izar Izewero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">jam keewo ni aztsotse</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">Jamkeewonwere azeyat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">b́ beyir n shúúnon b́ wottsosh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">shúúts eeno, mangonat angon neesh b́woto geyife» boetfo.<verse eid="REV 4:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5"/>
  <para style="s">Mas'aafonat mereeron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EZK 2:9-10">Hzk'. 2:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:11">Isa. 29:11</ref> </char>
    </note> B́ naashi jooratse beedek'tso k'ani kishatse, b́ gitse bootso bíats guut'etso shawat matabon togets mas'aafi k'odo tbek'i. <verse eid="REV 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2"/>Melaki kup' iko k'áári eenon «Mahatebwotsi biishr k'odets mas'aafo wogosh bín geyitwo kone?» ett b́ keewfere t bek'i. <verse eid="REV 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3"/>Ernmó daron wotowa datsatse wee datsoniyere dashe k'odets mas'aafo wogitwonat b́ gitso s'iilo bísh faletso konwor aali b́teshi. <verse eid="REV 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4"/>K'odets mas'aafo wogitwonat b́gitso s'iilosh bodtso daatseyo b́k'aztsosh ayidek'at ti eepi, <verse eid="REV 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 49:9">Aze. 49:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa. 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10">10</ref> </char></note> Manoor eenashwotsitsi iko «Eepk'aye, hamb Yhud jirotse wottso Dawit s'ap'o da'adek're, bí k'odets mas'aafonat shawat matabwotsi wogosh falitwe» bíeti taasha.<verse eid="REV 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6</char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa. 53:7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:10">Zek. 4:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Haniyere il naashi jooronat awd kashets azeetswots dagotse, eenashwots dagotsnowere shukeets mereer artso b́ need'efere tbek'i, mereran shawat k'alonat shawat ááwwotsi detsfe b́tesh, bo dats jamomaants wosheets Ik'i Shayirwotsiye. <verse eid="REV 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7"/>Bí waat naashi jooratse beyirwo k'anikishatse mas'aafi k'odo k'aaú b́dek'i, <verse eid="REV 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 141:2">Dub. 141:2</ref> </char></note> mas'aafi k'odo b́ dek'or azeets kashets awdwotsnat hiye awd eenashwotsn mereero shinats bobaron bogúp'gup'i, ik ikon begeno detsfno bo teshi, mank'o S'ayinwots Ik' k'on wottso it'ano bín s'eents awntsi agelgiliyo detsfno boteshi. <verse eid="REV 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 33:3">Dub. 33:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:1">98:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:10">Isa. 42:10</ref> </char></note> Handr duubo hank'o ett boduubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">«N s'atson naar naarotse, noon keew jamotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">jir jirotse, bí ashuwotsitse</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">Ashuwotsi Ik'osh keewosh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">nee n shukeetsotse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">mas'aafi k'odo de'er</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">matabman bitsosh faltso k'osho konwor aaliye,<verse eid="REV 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:6">Kesh. 19:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:6">Bek'. 1:6</ref> </char>
    </note> No Ik'oshowere kahaniwotsnat mengsto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">bowotitwk'o woshrne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">datsatsnowere naashitúne.»<verse eid="REV 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:10">Dan. 7:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Man maants ts'ilor naashi jooron, azeets kashetswotsnat eenashúwots gúúratse ay melakiwots k'ááro t shishi, bo ayonwere ay kumonat ay miliyeniyon tawetkne bo teshi, <verse eid="REV 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12"/>een k'ááron,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">«Shukeets mereero ango, gaalo, dantelfo, kúp'o, shúúts eeno, mangonat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">údo dek'osh bísh geykee» boeti.<verse eid="REV 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13"/>Daronat datsatse, datsoniyere dashe aats k'ari gitsotsi azeets jamo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">«B́ naashi jooratse beyirwonat mererosh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">udo, shúúts eeno, mangonat angon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">Dúre dúren tuur dúrosh b́borfetso wotowe!» bo eree t shishiri.<verse eid="REV 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14"/>Awd kashets azetswotswere «Amen!» boeti, hiye awd eenashwotswere bo baron gúp'gúp'at bosagadi.<verse eid="REV 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6"/>
  <para style="s">Shawat Mahatabiyotsi K'eshetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1"/>Haniyere il mereero shawat mahatabiyotsitsere shintso b́ wogefere t bek'i. Azets kashets awdwotsitsere iko guumi k'áárok'o k'ááron «Wowe!» bí eree tshishi. <verse eid="REV 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 1:8">Zek. 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:3">6:3</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 6:6">6</ref> </char></note> Hamb nas' Farsho t bek'i, farsh manats beyirwonwere joogo detsdek'ke b́ teshi, aklilyono bísh imeyi, bíwere da'atso wotar da'otse da'omaants amoosh b́ keshi.<verse eid="REV 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3"/>Mereronu gitl mahatabo b́ wogor, azeets kashets gitlo «Wowe!» bí eree t shishi. <verse eid="REV 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 1:8">Zek. 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:2">6:2</ref> </char></note> K'osh taw k'ak'ok'o bírts Farsho b́ weyi, farshatse beyirwosho jeeno datsatsere b́ t'afitwok'onat ashuwots boatsatseyo bos'uwetwok'o b́ woshish alo bísh imeyi, een shiki goradono imeyi.<verse eid="REV 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ZEC 6:2">Zek. 6:2</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 6:6">6</ref> </char>
    </note> Mereero keezlo mahatabo b́ wogor azeets kashets keezlo «Wowe!» bí eree t shishi, hamb aak' Farsho t bek'i, Farshats beyirwonwere maraaro b́ kishats detsdek'tniye b́ teshi, <verse eid="REV 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6"/>azeets kashets awdwots dagotse waats k'arok'o artso t shishi, k'aranwere «Kiloyi badok'o sndeyo ik aaw demozo, ik kilonat badok'o gesho ik aaw damozo wotowe, zeyitonat weyiniyonmo bíawaasherewok'wa!» b́ eree t shishi.<verse eid="REV 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7"/>Mereero awdl mahatabo b́ wogor azeets kashets awdlo k'ááro «Wowe» bí eree t shishi, <verse eid="REV 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 14:21">Hzk'. 14:21</ref> </char></note> ando búúd farsho t bek'i, farshatse beyirwo shúútso k'ira eteeka b́ tesh, si'olwere b́ shutsatse b́ sha'efere b́ teshi, k'ironat si'olnowere datsatsere aawdotse ik kisho k'ees'on, k'ak'on, mariyonat datsatsi s'ootson bo úd'itwok'o alo boosh b́ imi.<verse eid="REV 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9"/>Utsl mahatabo b́wogor Ik' aap'tsonat bo imts gawi jangosh ud'ets ashúwots kasho wosh t'iintsef t'arap'ezi shirotse t bek'i, <verse eid="REV 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10"/>boowere een k'ááron «S'ayinonat arikeewets jam falts doonzono! datsatse beyiru ashuwotsats angshr noosh weer worsho n k'azet awrish b́ borfetsone!» ett bokúhi. <verse eid="REV 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11"/>Bosh ik ikon tahi nas' geenzo imeyi, bokok'o ando aani úd'etwots, bonk'o guuts wottswots bo eshúwots taawo b́ s'enfetsosh múk' gizeyosh kashde'er boteshetwok'o keeweyi.<verse eid="REV 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="REV 11:13">Bek'. 11:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 3:15">Iyo. 3:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat. 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-25">Mar. 13:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25">Luk'. 21:25</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il mereero shrtl mahatabo b́ wogor b́ maants t s'iili, mann een datsi shek'eyo b́woti, aawnwere shiyani tahok'o aak' b́ wutsi, aashitsunu b ats jamo s'atsok'o bir b́ wutsi, <verse eid="REV 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isa. 34:4</ref> </char></note> Joshon jongi kup'o belsi mito b́shek'ere b́shuwo b́mitaatse b́ ooshfok'o k'eenwots daratsere datsats oosh bowtsi. <verse eid="REV 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 16:20">Bek'. 16:20</ref> </char></note> Daronwere branok'o k'odeyat k'azb́tuwi, guruwotsnat aatso boon b́gúúrts dats jametswots bobeyoke k'aw'ebowtsi. <verse eid="REV 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 2:19">Isa. 2:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 21">21</ref> </char></note> Datsatsi nungúswots, altswots, kes'i naashwots, gaaletswots, kup'uwots, guutswotsnat guuts woteraw jametswots gop'onat guruwotsitsi shútsi s'alwotsits aash bowtsi, <verse eid="REV 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos. 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:30">Luk'. 23:30</ref> </char></note> Gurwotsnat shútsi s'alwotsnsh, «No ats girshoore! naashi jorats beyirwo shinatse, mereero fayatse noon aatswere! <verse eid="REV 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 2:11">Iyu. 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mil. 3:2</ref> </char></note> Bo fayi aaw eeno waare, kone b́ shinatse need'o falitwoni?» bo eti.<verse eid="REV 6:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7"/>
  <para style="s">Bale habe awd kúm Israe'el ashuwots</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JER 49:36">Erm. 49:36</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:2">Dan. 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:5">Zek. 6:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Haniyere il awd melakiwots awd dats túngúshatse boned'efere t bek'i, boowere datsats wotowa aats k'araats wee mitats jongo b́ jongerawok'o aawud kaaton datsats weyiru jongwotsi dets bodek'i. <verse eid="REV 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2"/>Beyar beetwo Izar Izewerko mahatabo detstso k'osh melakiyo aawu keshon b́ wafere t bek'i, datsonat aats k'aron bo awaashish alo boosh imets awd melakiwots maants b́ k'aaro eenshdek't, <verse eid="REV 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Hzk'. 9:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 9:6">6</ref> </char></note> «Ik'o guutswots barats mahatabo no togfetsosh, datso wotowa aats k'aro wee mitwotsi t'afik'ayere» ett b́ kúhi. <verse eid="REV 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4"/>Boats maatab togets ashuwots taawo t shishi, Israe'el jir jamotse matabon togets ashuwots taawo bale habe awd kumno botesh. <verse eid="REV 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5"/>Matabo boats togetswots Yihud jirotse tatse git kumo, Robel jirotse tatse git kumo, Gad jirotse tatse git kumo, <verse eid="REV 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6"/>Aser jirotse tatse git kumo, Nftalem jirotse tatse git kumo, Minaase jirotse tatse git kumo, <verse eid="REV 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7"/>Sm'on jirotse tatse git kúmo, Lewi jirotse tatse git kumo, Yisakor jirotse tatse git kumo, <verse eid="REV 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8"/>Zablon jirotse tatse git kumo, Yosef jirotse tatse git kumo, Biniyam jirotse tatse git kumne bo teshi.<verse eid="REV 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Na's taho tahats ay ashuwots</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9"/>Haniyere il t s'iili, konwor taaw b́faleraw ashuwotsno t bek'i, boowere ash ashonat naarotse, b́ jironat noon keewiru jamotse keeshkne boteshi, boowere nas' tahi geenzo tahdek't woli maaro bokishats detsdek't naashi jooronat mereero shinatse boned'efera bo teshi, <verse eid="REV 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10"/>een k'ááron kúhefetst,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:10">«Kashiyo naashi jooratse beyirwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:10">no Ik'o Izar Izewernat mereroke!» bo etiri.<verse eid="REV 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11"/>Melaki jamwotswere naashi jooronat eenashúwots azeets kashets awdwotsi gúrdek't bo need'efere bo teshi, naashi jori shinatsowere bobaron gúp'gúp'at Ik'osh bosagadi, <verse eid="REV 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12"/>hank'o bo eti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:12">«Amen! shiimo, een woto, dani teleefo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">udo, mango, ango, kúp'o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">no Ik'o Izar Izewersh dúre dúron b́ tuutso dúre dúrosh b́ borfetsosh wotowe! Amen!»<verse eid="REV 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13"/>Enashwotsitsere iko t maants aanat «Nas' tahi geenzo tahtsanots kone bo? Aawokneya boweyi?» bí etí.<verse eid="REV 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:14</char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan. 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:21">Mat. 24:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:19">Mar. 13:19</ref> </char>
    </note> Taawere «Doonzono, nee danfnee» tieti. Bíwere taash hank'o bíeti, «Hanots gond bek' eenotse kesht waakne, botahonowere mereero s'atson mashdek't nas' woshk'rerne, <verse eid="REV 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15"/>Manshowere Ik'i naashi jori shinatse wotde'er t'úwonat aawon Ik' mootse bísh finitúne, b́ naashi jorats bedek'tsonwere boosh beyi moo wotitwe. <verse eid="REV 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 49:10">Isa. 49:10</ref> </char></note> Eshe haniyak k'aak'eratsno, shashweratsno, aawo boon jod'atse, aaw k'angro boon daatsratse, <verse eid="REV 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 23:1">Dub. 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:23">Hzk'. 34:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 23:2">Dub. 23:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:10">Isa. 49:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:8">25:8</ref> </char></note> Naashi jooro dagotse fa'a mereero boon jintsi wotitwe, kashi aatsi t'úp'okowere boon jishitwe, Ik'o aac'u jamo bo ááwatse firitwe.»<verse eid="REV 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8"/>
  <para style="s">Shaawatl matabo b́k'eshetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1"/>Mererman shaawatl matabo b́wogtsok'on sa'at badok'oosh darotse s'ik eto wotb́wtsi. <verse eid="REV 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2"/>Ik'i shinatse need'iru shawat melakiwotsno tbek'i, booshowere shawat gaatwotsi imeyi.<verse eid="REV 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:3</char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="AMO 9:1">Amo. 9:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 30:1">Kesh. 30:1</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 30:3">3</ref> </char>
    </note> Awntson dozets it'ano bíts t'iintsefu detsdek'ts k'osh melakyo waat wosh t'intseyiru t'arap'ezi ganoke need'b́dek'i, naashi jori shinatse fa'a awntson dozets it'ano bíyatse s'uwyef t'arap'ezats S'ayn jamwots Ik' k'ononton b́ t'intsit ay it'ano bísh imk'reyi. <verse eid="REV 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4"/>It'ani s'uwo S'ayinwots Ik' k'ononton melakiyo kishotse Ik'o shinats b́keshi. <verse eid="REV 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 16:12">Lew. 16:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:2">Hzk'. 10:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:16">Kesh. 19:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">Bek'. 11:19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref> </char></note> Haniyere il melakiyo bíyats it'aan t'intseyiru dets dek't wosh t'intseyiru t'arap'eezatse taw k'ak'o k'aa'údek' bín s'eents dek't datsomants shap'b́k'ri, awushi guumo, k'aaro, awushi p'alk'o, datsi shek'ewonwere wotbwtsi.<verse eid="REV 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaatwotsi fugeetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6"/>Shawat gaatwotsi detsdek'ts shawat melakiwots gaatwotsi fugosh k'anbodek'i.<verse eid="REV 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:7</char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 9:23-25">Kesh. 9:23-25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Hzk'. 38:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Melaki shintso fugef gaatman b́fugi, shetsonat s'atson bín eeh wutsts tawo wotb́wtsi, datsatsowere juwee b́wtsi, datsatsno keezl kisho mis'bwtsi, mitwotsitsnowere keezl kisho mis'b́wtsi, atts bodjamonwere mis'bwtsi.<verse eid="REV 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8"/>Gitl melakiyonwere gaatman b́fugi, guri een arts keewonwere mis'fetst aats k'arots b́ juweyi, aats k'ari keezl kishonwere s'ats wotb́wtsi, <verse eid="REV 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9"/>Aats k'arots beyiru kash detsts azetswotsitse keezl kisho k'irb́wtsi, markabwotsitse keezl kisho awaashb́wtsi.<verse eid="REV 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:10</char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:12">Isa. 14:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Keezl melakiyonwere gaatman b́fugi, tipeets c'eeshok'o aat'iru een k'eeno darotse fed'b́wtsi, b́fed'were fokitsi keezl kishonat aats t'up'uwotsatsa b́tesh. <verse eid="REV 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 9:15">Erm. 9:15</ref> </char></note> K'eenman shúútsonwere s'aama eteeka, aatsotsi keezl kishonwere s'aam wotb́wtsi, s'aam wotts aatsatse tuutson ay ashuwots bok'iri.<verse eid="REV 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12</char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hzk'. 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Iyu. 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref> </char>
    </note> Awdl melakiyo gaatman b́fugi, aaw keezl kisho, aashitsu keezel kisho, k'eenwotsitsi keezl kisho togeb́wtsi, mann bo keezl kisho t'aluw b́wtsi, mank'oon aawotse keezl kisho t'úwotse keezl kisho shanalko wotbwtsi.<verse eid="REV 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13"/>Haniyere il ts'ilor aak iko dari taalotse biidfere k'áári eenon «Oorts melaki keezwots bo gaati k'aaro boshishiyor datsatse beyiru ashuwotssh indowe boosha! indowe boosha! indowe boosha!» etfetst b́kuhefere t shishi.<verse eid="REV 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1"/>Úútsl melakiyo gaato b́fugi, mann darotse datsats fed'ts k'een iko tbek'i, ayi dashan wokts gop'o bín k'esheetwo bísh imeyi. <verse eid="REV 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:28">Aze. 19:28</ref> </char></note> Bí ayidek't dashan wokts gop'o b́k'eshi, s'uwonwere taw awuri eenotse keshf s'uwok'o ayidashan wokts gop'manitse b́keshi, gop'manitse keshts s'uwatse tuutson aawonat jongon t'alu bowtsi, <verse eid="REV 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 10:12-15">Kesh. 10:12-15</ref> </char></note> S'umanitsnowere p'eluwots datsats k'azbokeshi, datsatsi ok'oolishwots angok'o ango boosh imeyi, <verse eid="REV 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4"/>Datsatsi bod wotowa aaw naari atts keewo kon naari mito bo aawashirawok'o boosh keeweyi, awaashiyo bofalitwonmó bobaratse Ik' matabo deshaw ashuwots s'uzi b́tesh. <verse eid="REV 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5"/>Bonor b́wotiyal úúts shashosh bo kúnituwok'owa bako boúd'ituwok'o boosh alo imeratse, p'eluwots boats bobetsts kúúno ok'olsho asho b́shaas'ori ashuwotssh b́weeshfok'oyiye. <verse eid="REV 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 3:21">Iyo. 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:3">Erm. 8:3</ref> </char></note> Aawu manotsitse ashuwots k'iro geyitúne, ernmó daatsratsne, k'iroshowere tewnitune, wotowa eree k'iro boatse k'aywos'etuwe.<verse eid="REV 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:4">Iyu. 2:4</ref> </char>
    </note> P'eluwots kes' amoosh k'andek'ts farshwotsi arkno botesh, botookatse awntsi akililiyo arts keewo fa'e b́ tesh, boshiitsonwere ash shiitsa arka b́tesh. <verse eid="REV 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 1:16">Iyu. 1:16</ref> </char></note> Mááts tooki s'iiro arts tooki s'iiro detsfno botesh, bo gáshonwere eeshi gásh arka b́ tesh. <verse eid="REV 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 2:5">Iyu. 2:5</ref> </char></note> Bogeraatsowere bir arts t'ururi tahdek'kno boteshi, bobangi k'aaronúwere kes'o maants gaalfetst amiru ay farshuwotsnat seregelwots boshishiyru k'áárok'oyiye b́teshi. <verse eid="REV 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10"/>Ok'oolishi dúshok'o dúshonat bín boshas'etwo detsfne boteshi, bodúshootse ashuwotsi bín úúts shashosh bokúúnit ango detsfne boteshi. <verse eid="REV 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11"/>Nugúsono detsfne botesh, bíwere dashan gop'ts gop'i melakiyoni, b́shútsonwere Ibrayist'i noon keew keewon Abadoni,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abadon: </char><char style="ft">Eto jam t'afitka eta. </char></note> Griki noon keew keewon Ap'oli'oni eteefoni.<verse eid="REV 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12"/>Indowe eteef shintso beshere, eshe haniyere il k'osh git indowe eto weetwe.<verse eid="REV 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:13</char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 30:1-3">Kesh. 30:1-3</ref> </char>
    </note> Shirtl melakiyo b́ ezbedo b́fugi, eshe Ik'i shinatse fa'a awntson dozets it'ani wosho bíyatse t'iintsef t'arap'ezats awd k'alwotsoke k'ááro b́keshfere tshishi. <verse eid="REV 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14"/>K'áármanwere ezbedo detsdek'ts shrtl melakiyosh «Fok eeno Efrat'esitse tipeets melaki awdwotsi biishe!» bíet <verse eid="REV 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15"/>Sa'atmannat aawmansh shaashmannat worwotmansh k'andek'ts melaki awdwots ash naarotse keezotse ik kisho boúd'ituwok'o bo biitseyi. <verse eid="REV 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16"/>Farshon kes'fuwots ayo git bal miliyoniyok'o b́woto tshishi. <verse eid="REV 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17"/>Farshetswotsnat farshats beedk'tswotsi bek'on t bek'tso hank'oyi, bogeratse teshts t'ururiyo tawk'ak'ok'o bíra, darimaac'ok'o aak'a, ac'uwok'owere arka b́tesh, farshwots tookonúwere eeshi took arka b́tesh, bo nonotse tawonat s'uwonú diniyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ainiya: </char><char style="ft">Eto bíaat'or keetsi shok'ok'o shook'f kaashk'on aat'ef, aat'iru shútsi laluwa. </char></note> b́keshfere b́tesh, <verse eid="REV 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18"/>Bononótse bokishts tawon, s'uwonat diniyo keez fayanotsn, ash naaro keezotse ik kisho b́úd'eyi. <verse eid="REV 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19"/>Manwere eegoshe farshwots ango bo nononat bo dúshots b́ teshtsoshe, bo dúshonwere dawunzi dúsha bíari, dawunzi tookonowere detsfno, ashonowere waas'o bokashir manna b́tesh.<verse eid="REV 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 115:4-7">Dub. 115:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:15-17">135:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:23">Dan. 5:23</ref> </char>
    </note> Fayanotsn k'irraniyere oorts ash naarwots bokishi finatse aanat naandrone eraatsno, fo'erawonat awntson, ambaron, k'áázon shútsonat mitoon dozets bek'o wee shisho falaaw, wee sha'o falaaw woteraw ik'uwotsi ik'iyo k'ayatsne. <verse eid="REV 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21"/>Mank'owere kash úd'tswotsi bowottsotse, aton shetonfiinatse, bowidonat boúmp'atse naandrone eratsne.<verse eid="REV 9:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10"/>
  <para style="s">Melakiyonat k'odets mas'aafon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1"/>Haniyere okoon daawn tahdek'ts melaki k'osho kúp'o darotse b́ oot'fere t bek'i, b́ tookatsowere gúúrdek't beyirwo Ik'i edjoka b́tesh, b́ shiitso aawok'oyi, b́tufuwots tawu írok'ono botesh, <verse eid="REV 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2"/>Wogk'reets k'odets mas'aaf muk'u b́ kishatse detsdek'tni b́tesh, b́ k'ani tufo aats k'araats, b́ giri tufonowere datsats gedb́dek'i, <verse eid="REV 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3"/>K'adiru eeshi k'arok'o arts k'aari eenonowere b́ kuhi, b́ kuhorowere shawat awushi guumwotsu bok'aaro bo shishiyi. <verse eid="REV 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4"/>Shawat awushi guumwotswere noono bokeewtsok'on taa guut'o gawutdek'i, ernmó «Shawat aawush guummanots bokeewtso ipde'er áátson deshde'e bako guut'k'aye!» etiru k'ááro darotse tshishi.<verse eid="REV 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5"/>Haniyere il aats k'aaronat datsats b́ need'efere tbek'ts melakiyo b́ k'ani kisho dambaan k'aaúdek't <verse eid="REV 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6"/>Dúre dúrosh beyar beetwon, daronat bítse beyirwotsi, datsunat bgitsotse beyirwotsn, aats k'aaronat bítse beyirwotsn aztso Izar Izewer shútson taart hank'o bíeti, «Eshe haniyak ja'aratsese! <verse eid="REV 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5-7</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kesh. 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:40">Iwi. 32:40</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:7">Iwi. 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 3:7">Amo. 3:7</ref> </char></note> Ernmó melakiyo shawatlo ezbedi k'ááro b́shisht aawwots b́guuts nebiyiwotssh b́ nabts doo shishi b́keewtsok'on ááshts Ik'i keewo s'eenetwe.» <verse eid="REV 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8"/>Maniyere il darotse tshishts k'ááro «Aats k'aaronat datsatse need'iru melakiyo kishatse fa'onat wogeets mas'aafi k'odo amr k'aaúde'e» ett aaniyi taash b́keewi.<verse eid="REV 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9"/>Melakiyokowere amaat «K'odets mas'aaf múk'na'ú taash ime» tieti, bíwere «Mas'aafmani k'aa'úde'er moowe, nmaac'otse s'aamo wotitwaniye, nnonotsnmó mas'ook'o shawetwaniye» bí eti.<verse eid="REV 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:8-10</char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EZR 2:8-33">Izr. 2:8-33</ref> </char>
    </note> Taawere mas'aaf múk'na'a k'odeetsú melakiyo kishatse k'aaú dek'at tmeyi, tnonotsnowere mas'ook'o shaawbwtsi, bin matk'riyakoon tmaac'o s'aam wotb́wtsi. <verse eid="REV 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11"/>Maniyere il «Jir aywots jangosh, ash ashosh, k'osh k'osh naari noon keewiru ashuwotsnat nugúsuwots jangosh ando aani bek'on keewo neesh geyife» ett taash keeweyi.<verse eid="REV 10:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11"/>
  <para style="s">Git gawwotsi woshetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:30">Hzk'. 40:30</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:1-2">Zek. 2:1-2</ref> </char>
    </note> Haniyere il bín indosh wotit guumbok'oo taash imeyi, hank'owere taash eteyi, «Tuur Ik' moonat wosh bíyats t'intseyiru t'arap'ezo indowe, bíyokere Ik' ik'irwotsnowere taawwe, <verse eid="REV 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 21:24">Luk'. 21:24</ref> </char></note> Ik' mooniyere uratsi jébó k'ayik'rowe, bíhe Ik' ash woterawwotssh imek b́wottsotse bín indk'aye, Ik' ash woterawwots S'ayin kitu habe git shashosh net'etúne, <verse eid="REV 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3"/>t gaw gitetswots shiyani taho tahde'er ik kumonat git bale shiits aawosh bek'on bo keewitwok'o k'alitwe.»<verse eid="REV 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ZEC 4:3">Zek. 4:3</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 4:11-14">11-14</ref> </char>
    </note> Bowere datsatsi doonzo shinats need'it weeyra eteef zeyiti mit gitwotsnat git c'eeshwotsiye, <verse eid="REV 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5"/>konworu boon t'afiyo b́ geyiyal tawo bonoonotse keer bo balngarwotsi b́ mitsiti, bonowere t'afiyi geyitu jamo b́ k'irit hank'one. <verse eid="REV 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Naash. 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 7:17-19">Kesh. 7:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 4:8">1 Sam. 4:8</ref> </char></note> Bo bek'on bokeewit aaw manotsitse awsho b́ buyawok'o daro is'osh alo detsfne, mank'o aatswotsi s'atso maants woniyosh, bogeets gize jamor konnari fayon datsu jot'osh alo detsfne.<verse eid="REV 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan. 7:7</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:5-7">Bek'. 13:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:8">17:8</ref> </char>
    </note> Bo gawono bo ishiyakon datsi ayi dashan gop'ts gop'otse keshet s'ootso bonton kaarar boon da'itwe, bonowere ud'itwe, <verse eid="REV 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 1:9-10">Isa. 1:9-10</ref> </char></note> bodúnonwere jewron s'eegefok'on Sedom wee Gbs'i eteets een kitu weer eenats girmaanitwe, kitanwere bo doonz biitse b́ jitetsúniye. <verse eid="REV 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9"/>Ay jironat ay ash naaron, ay naari noon keewon noono keewirwotsnat ash ashuwots keez aawonat aaw badosh bo duunman s'iletuune, boduunonúwere b́ dukerawok'o bazitune. <verse eid="REV 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10"/>Git nebíyiwotswere datsatsi ashuwotsi kic'it boteshtsotse, datsatse beyiru ashuwots nebíyi manots k'irtsosh bogeneúti, gene'ono iko ikosh imo imetwe. <verse eid="REV 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 37:10">Hzk'. 37:10</ref> </char></note> Ernmó keez aawonat aaw bado b́ beshiyakon kasho boosh imet kashi jongo Ik'oke waat dunuwotsits b́ kindi, botufonowere bo need'i, boon bek'ts ashuwotswere ayidek't shatbowtsi. <verse eid="REV 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 2:11">2 Naash. 2:11</ref> </char></note> Maniyere il git nebiyiwotssh «Hakan dambaan keere!» etiru k'áári eeno darotse boshishi, bo balngarwots boon bos'ilfere dawúnon daro maants bokeshi. <verse eid="REV 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 6:12">Bek'. 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref> </char></note> manoori sa'ator een datsi shek'eyo b́ woti, kitmanko taatsotsere ik kisho grshbutsi, datsi shek'eyatse tuutsonowere shawat kum ashuwots bo k'iri, k'irotse ortswotsuwere ayidek't boshati, daratstso Ik'o Izar Izewerno bomangiyi.<verse eid="REV 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14"/>Gitlts indowe eto beshere, keezl indowe eto káári weetwe.<verse eid="REV 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shawatl fugef gaato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:18">Kesh. 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dan. 2:44</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14-27">7:14-27</ref> </char>
    </note> Shawatl melakiyo gaato b́ fúgi, daratsnowere «Datsatsi mengstu no doonz Izar Izewerkonat bísh Krstossh wotwtserane anda, bíwere dúre dúrosh naashitwe,» etiru een k'áárwots bo shisheyi. <verse eid="REV 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16"/>Ik' shinaatsere bo naashi jorats beyiru hiye awd eenashwots bobaron gúp'gúp'at Ik'osh bosagadi, <verse eid="REV 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17"/>hank'owere bo eti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">«Beyirwonat teshtsono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">jam falts doonzo Izar Izewero!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">een wotts alo n kishots woshdek'tsonat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">n naashtsosh neen uderone.<verse eid="REV 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:5">Dub. 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 110:5">110:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:13">115:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik' ash woterawwots bofayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">n fayonwere b́ weyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">k'irtswots angsho bodatsit gizeyo b́ bodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">N guuts nebiyiwotsnat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">nshúúts mangiru S'ayinwots,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">k'ac'a c'inwotsnat een eenwotssh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">Bok'awntso nimet gizeyo bodre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">datsu t'afitswotsi n t'afit aawo bodre.»<verse eid="REV 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="REV 8:5">Bek'. 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21">21</ref> </char>
    </note> Daaratse fa'a Ik'i moo b́ k'eesheyi, b́ taari tabotonu Ik' mootse b́ be'eyi. Awshi p'alk'o, k'ááro, guumi k'aaro, datsi shek'ewonat ay shetsonwere wotb́wtsi.<verse eid="REV 11:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12"/>
  <para style="s">Máátsunat daruwon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1"/>Maniyere il eenonat adits milikito darotse b́be'eyi, aaw tahdek'tsú, aashitsu btufoniyere dash geddek'ts, tatse git k'eenwotsi jip'ets akliliyo btookats gúúfdek'ts, mááts iku b́be'eyi. <verse eid="REV 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2"/>Biwere na'i maac'i bteshi, shuwoshowere na'i shambo b́waare kic'at bkuhefere btesh.<verse eid="REV 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan. 7:7</ref> </char>
    </note> Andoor k'osh milikito darotse b́be'eyi, shawat tookwotsnat tats k'aluwotsi detsts een bir daruwo b́be'eyi, b́tookatsnowere shawat zewdiwotsi gúfdek'tni b́tesh, <verse eid="REV 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 8:10">Dan. 8:10</ref> </char></note> b́ dúshoon k'eenwotsitsi keez kisho darotse geetsdek't datsats fet'b́k'ri, máátsman bshuwor bna'o k'oot'osh gawk'raat daruman shuwosh etiru máátsu shinatse need'b́wutsi, <verse eid="REV 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 66:7">Isa. 66:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:9">Dub. 2:9</ref> </char></note> máátsunwere ash jamo birri gumbon keewit nungush na'o shuubk'ri, bnaaynmó Ik'o naashi jooro maants zafdek'eyi, <verse eid="REV 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6"/>máátsunwere woruwo maants áásho k'az bwos'i, manoke ik kume git balonat shiits aawosh it'ide'er detson bkoteet beyoko Ik'o bish manoke k'anitniye b́teshi.<verse eid="REV 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan. 10:13</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:9">Yhu. 9</ref> </char>
    </note> Darotse kes'o tuub́wtsi, Mika'elnat b́ melakiwotsn daruwonton bokeec'eyi, darwonat b́ melakiwotsowere aaniyidek't bokaari. <verse eid="REV 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8"/>Ernmó daruwonat b́melakiyon da'eniye bowtsi, maniyere okonowere boosh darotse beyoko daatseratse. <verse eid="REV 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Aze. 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:18">Luk'. 10:18</ref> </char></note> Daruw eenonwere dash datsats shap'k'reyi, bí dats jamu darituwo Diyablosi wee Shed'ana err s'eegef shints dawunzoniye. Bí datsats b́juweyi, b́melakiwotswere bínton bojuweyi.<verse eid="REV 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:9-11">Iyo. 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:1">Zek. 3:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il k'áári een iko darotse hank'o bíetfere tshishi, «Eshe and Ik'o kashiyo, b́kup'onat b́mengston waare. Bíko Krstos alo waare! no eshuwotsi no Ik'o shinatse t'úwe aawo s'aamifets teshtso no eshuwotsi s'aamifo juwewtsere, <verse eid="REV 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11"/>Boowere mereero s'atsonat bo gawuts gawatse tuutson bín da'adek'rne, bo kashosh bobút'erawo botoko k'irosh beshidek't imrne, <verse eid="REV 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12"/>Mansh daruwotsnat bogitsotse beyiru jamwots gene'úwore! múk' aawu s'uz bísh b́ oortsok'o b́dantsotse Diyablos fayi eenon it maants b́ oot'tsotse datsonat aats k'arwotssh indowe itsha!»<verse eid="REV 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13"/>Daruwonú datsats b́ juweetsok'o b́ bek'tsok'on nungush na'a shuuts máátsu b́ giishi, <verse eid="REV 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:25">Dan. 7:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">12:7</ref> </char></note> máátsunwere worwotse bish k'aniyets beyokok biirr biametwok'o aaki bangok'o arts bang gitwotsi bish imk'reyi, manoknowere dawunzman shinatse wokaar keez natonat badosh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Keez natonat badoon: </char><char style="ft">Griki mas'afatse dúra (zemen), dúrwotsi, dúri bada etfe hanwere Daniel mas'afatse 7:25; 12:7 atse guut'ere. </char></note> sheengshdetson detseyat bkotefera bteshi. <verse eid="REV 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15"/>Máátsu di'on bdek'etwok'owat dawunzman fokitsi aatsok'o bodts aatso b́noonotse s'ud dek't bshuuts weeron b́kuut'i. <verse eid="REV 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16"/>Ernmó datsu máátsmansh bgaatsi, bnononowere k'eshedek'at daruman b́noonotse b́s'udts foko ushbk'ri. <verse eid="REV 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17"/>Daruwonú máátsu fayat bnaar oortswotsnton kec'ewosh bíami, boowere Ik' aluwotsi kotfwotsnat Iyesus jangosh amaneeyat gawirwotsiye. <verse eid="REV 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18"/>Daruwonwere aats k'ari gúúratsi shiyaats need'b́wutsi.<verse eid="REV 12:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13"/>
  <para style="s">S'oots gitetswots</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:3">Dan. 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:3">Bek'. 17:3</ref>, <ref loc="REV 17:7-12">7-12</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il s'oots iko aats k'arotse b́ keshfere t bek'i, tats k'alwotsnat shawat tookon detsfe, b́ k'alwotsatsnowere tats zewdiwots fa'ano bo teshi, b́ tookatsnowere Ik' c'ashi shúútswots fa'ane, <verse eid="REV 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:4-6">Dan. 7:4-6</ref> </char></note> t bek'ts s'ootsonwere maah arka b́tesh, b́ tufuwotswere dibiya eteets s'ootso tufo, b́ nononu Eeshi noone bí ari, daruwonu b́ took angonat b́ took naashijoro een alonowere s'otsmansh b́ imi. <verse eid="REV 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3"/>S'ootsman tookwotsitse ikonwere k'irosh betsit gawo b́ detstsok'o t bek'i, ernmó k'irosh betsit gaawman kash b́wútsi, dats jamo adon s'oots man shuutso shoyidek't b́tuwi. <verse eid="REV 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4"/>S'ootsosh alo b́ imetsotse ash jamwots daruwosh bosagadi, «S'ootsman artso kone? Bínton kaarosh falitwo kone?» ett bísh bosagadi.<verse eid="REV 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5"/>S'ootsmanshwere bog taana etonat Ik'o b́c'ashet aap'osh noono bish imeyi, habe git shashosh alon b́ finitwok'owa eteyi. <verse eid="REV 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5-6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:8">Dan. 7:8</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:36">11:36</ref> </char></note> Ik'onat Ik' shútso, b́beyokonat daaratse fa'úwotsn c'asho dek'b́twi. <verse eid="REV 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:21">Dan. 7:21</ref> </char></note> S'ayinwotsi kaarar b́ da'itwok'o alo bísh imeyi, naaronat jiron, k'osh k'osh noon keewon keewirwotsnat ash jamatse alo bísh imeyi. <verse eid="REV 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:28">Dub. 69:28</ref></char></note> Datsan bí azewortson tuut bo shúútso shukeets Mereero kashi mas'aafats guut'eraw datsatse beyiru jam ashuwots s'ootsosh bosagaditi.<verse eid="REV 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9"/>Waaz detstso fa'e wotiyal shiye! <verse eid="REV 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Erm. 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 43:11">43:11</ref> </char></note> «Mus'ewosh k'aniyetso mus'etwe, shiki goradon b́ k'iritwok'o k'aniyetso shiki goradon k'iritwe,» eshe S'ayinwots k'amonat imnetiyon b́ geyiyit hank'o gizeyoshe.<verse eid="REV 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11"/>K'osh s'ootso datsotse b́ keshfere t bek'i, mereerok'o git k'aluwotsi detsfe, b́ noon keew keewonwere daruwok'owiye b́ teshi, <verse eid="REV 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12"/>shints s'ootso shááto shegreshetso bí alon b́ finefere b́ teshi, datsonat biyatse beyiru jamwots shints s'oots mansh bosagaditwok'o b́woshi, s'ootsan k'irosh bín betsits gawotse kashits shints s'ootsoniye, <verse eid="REV 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13"/>gitl s'ootsanmó ashuwots shinatse tawo darotse datsats b́ orshfetsosh een adits finwotsi k'alfe b́ tesh. <verse eid="REV 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14"/>Shints s'ootsman shinatse adits keewwotsi b́k'alish imets milikitatse tuutson datsatse beyiru ashuwots danditni b́ teshi, shiki goradon gaawit kashts s'ootsman mangiyosh bín artso bofinitwok'o datsatse beyiru ashuwotsi azazitwe. <verse eid="REV 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15"/>Gitl s'ootso shints s'oots areyetsosh kashi jongo bí ímish alo bísh imeyi, kashi jongo b́ ímewwere ariyetsman noon keewo b́falitwok'onat bísh sagederaw jamwotsi ud'etwok'o b́ k'alishe. <verse eid="REV 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16"/>Gitl s'ootso múk'uwotsi wotowa een eenuwotsi, gaaletsuwotsi wotowa t'owwotsi, doonzwotsi wotowa guutsuwotsi, jamwots bo k'ani kishats wee bo barats milkto ger bodek'etuwok'o angnon b́ k'ali. <verse eid="REV 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17"/>Hannaari s'ootso shúútso b́ kitsiru mlkito wee b́ shúúts taaw deshawo asho konworu kéw wotowa kémo falatse.<verse eid="REV 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18"/>Dan telefo b́ geyiyit eshe hanokne, nib detstso s'ootsman taawo taawwe, b́ taawonwere b́ kitsir ashe, tawonwere shrt balonat shtse shrte (666).<verse eid="REV 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14"/>
  <para style="s">Mereeronat awd bale habe awd kum ashuwots</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EZK 9:4">Hzk'. 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:3">Bek'. 7:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il mereero hamb S'iyon gurats b́ need'efere t bek'i, bíntonuwere b́ shútsonat b́ nihi shúútson bo barats guut'ets habe awd bal kúm ashuwots fa'ane bo teshi, <verse eid="REV 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2"/>daratsere een aats k'aarok'onat een wotts guumok'o ayidek't een wotts k'aaro t shishi, t shishits k'aaronwere Begena eteets t'imbok'o bo t'imbor b́ shishiru k'arok'owiye bí ari. <verse eid="REV 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3"/>Naashi jooronat awd s'ootswots, eenashwots shinatsnowere bale habe awd kum ashuwots Ik'i dub handro boduubi, duubanowere datsatse aani keewdek'ets bale habe awd kum ashuwotsiyere okoon konworu danosh falratse. <verse eid="REV 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4"/>Bowere dngili bowottsotse máátsonton k'eet kiimatsne, mereero b́ sha'iru jamok b́ shuutso bo sha'iri. Bo Ik'onat mererosh k'aab shuwwots wotat t'ints ash naarotsere aaniy kewdek'etswotsiye. <verse eid="REV 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEP 3:13">Sof. 3:13</ref> </char></note> Bowere kooti keewo keewrakne, ik keewono boatse daatseratse.<verse eid="REV 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6"/>Haniyere okoon datsatse beyiru ash ashosh, ik naaro, k'osh k'osh noon keewon keewiru k'osh k'osh jir jamwotssh daniyosh dure dúri doo shishiyo detsts k'osh melakiyo dari taalotse b́ biidfere t bek'i. <verse eid="REV 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7"/>Een k'ááronoere «Ik'o sharere, mangiwere b́ angshi sa'ato bodre, daronat datson aats k'aaronat aats t'úp'o aztso Izar Izewersh sagadoore!» b́ eti.<verse eid="REV 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 21:9">Isa. 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:8">Erm. 51:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">Bek'. 18:2</ref> </char>
    </note> K'osh gitl melakiyonúwere «Mashiyit woyiniyon dutsets b widi biro ash jamosh ishitu ekeew Babilon eenu dihirane! dihirane!» ett gitl melakiyo shutsatse b́ weyiri.<verse eid="REV 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9"/>Kosh keezl melakiyo hank'o ett boshutso shoydek't b́weyiri, «S'ootsonat bí armansh sagadirwots, b́ milkto bo barats wee bokishats gedet jamwots, <verse eid="REV 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Isa. 51:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24">Aze. 19:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Hzk'. 38:22</ref> </char></note> Ik' fayi woyiniyon dútsets biro úshetúúne, weyiniyon dutsets bironowere b́ dutseraniyere b́ fayi wanc'ots tepeke, mank'o b́ S'ayin melakiwots shinatsnat mereero shinatse tawonat diniyon kúúnetune. <verse eid="REV 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 34:10">Isa. 34:10</ref> </char></note> Boon kic'iru tawumanitse keshiru s'úwo dúre dúrosh b́ borfetsosh dambaan b́ kesheti, s'ootsonat bí ar mansh sagadts b́ shúútsi mlikt manowere geddek'ts jamwots t'úwe aawon kashde'atsne.»<verse eid="REV 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12"/>Ik' tzaziyo kotirwotsnat Iyesusi amanon kup'ts S'ayinwotsatse kotet k'amo hanaatsnee.<verse eid="REV 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13"/>Daaratse hank'o etiru k'ááro tshishi, han guut'e, «Haniyere okoon doonzo Iyesusk wotar k'irituwots derekne!» S'ayin shayironúwere «Ee! bo angi maawatse kashbodeketwok'o bo fino shoydee'er weetwe» b́ eti.<verse eid="REV 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doonzo fayo datsatse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan. 7:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Haniyere il t s'iili, etnuwere nas' dawuno tbek'i, dawunmanotsatsnowere ash na'a artso beebdek'i, b́ tokatsowere awntsi akliliya eteetso jip'dek're, b́ kishatsnowere shash maac'ro detsdek're, <verse eid="REV 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Iyu. 3:13</ref> </char></note> K'osh melakiyonwere Ik' mootse kesht dawunatse beyiru mansh een k'ááron «N maac'ro de'er mááyo k'ec'ee! maay k'es'i sa'atonuwere t'inre!» <verse eid="REV 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16"/>Dawunatse beyiruwonwere maac'iro datso maants b́ deyiyi, datsunwere b́ k'es'eyi.<verse eid="REV 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17"/>K'osh melakiyonu daratsi Ik' mootse b́ keshi, bíwere maac'ri shasho detsfe b́ teshi.<verse eid="REV 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18"/>Tawatsnowere alo detsts k'osh melakiyo wosh t'intseyirwi ganoke kesht shash maac'ir detsts melakiyosh «Zúkud'ts shuwwots bokatstsotse shash maac'r man deyiwe! woyini zúkud' jamwotsi datsatsi woyiniyatse k'ut'de'er ko'iyuwe!» ett een k'aaron b́ kuhi. <verse eid="REV 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19"/>Melakiyonúwere maac'iro datso maants b́ deyiyi datsatsi woyini zúkud'ono b́ k'ut'i, een wotts Ik' fayo fis'eetwotso b́ juwi. <verse eid="REV 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 63:3">Isa. 63:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:15">Bek'. 19:15</ref> </char></note> Kitoniyere úratse fa'a woyini fis'eyirwotso fis'eyi, fis'eyirumaniyere Farshi lúgamok b́ borfetsosh dambaan een wotts keez bal kilo metrok'o wotit s'atso kesht b́ kuud'i.<verse eid="REV 14:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15"/>
  <para style="s">S'uwori fayuwotsi detsdek'ts melakiwotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1"/>K'osho eenonat adits milikito darotse t bek'i, Ik'i fayo boats b́ wotit s'uwaatsik wotts shawat fayuwotsi detsdek'ts shawat melakiwotsi tbek'i.<verse eid="REV 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2"/>Maniyere il tawo biitse eeh wutsts mastayti k'arok'o artso tbek'i, mank'o s'ootsonat s'ootso aro, b́shúútsonowere tawi milikito da'adek'tswotsi tbek'i, Ik'o boosh b́'imts begena eteefo detsdek't mastayiti aats k'ari ganoke need'dek'tni botesh. <verse eid="REV 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3"/>Ik' guutso Muse duubonat mereero duubono hank'o ett boduubfera botesh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">«Jam falts doonzo Izar Izewero!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">N fino eenonat adike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">Ashuwotssh nugúsono!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">nweero kááwonat arikee,<verse eid="REV 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JER 10:7">Erm. 10:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:9">Dub. 86:9</ref> </char>
    </note> Doonzono!! neen sharawonat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">nshúútso mangirawo kone?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">ns'uz S'ayin neene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">N kááw angsho b́be'eetsotse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">ash jamo wáár nshinatse sagaditwee.»<verse eid="REV 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 38:21">Kesh. 38:21</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il ts'iili, eshe hamb gawosh wotit dunkani wottso Ik'i S'ayin moo darotse k'eshe b́wutsi, <verse eid="REV 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6"/>shawat fayuwotsi detsdek'ts shawat melakiwots Ik'i mootse bokeshi, goliru s'ayin taho tahdek'tni botesh, bogeratsowere awntsi edon eddek'kno botesh. <verse eid="REV 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7"/>Awd s'ootswotsitse iko shawat melakiwotssh dúre dúron beyiru Ik'i fayo bín s'eents shawat awntsi wanc'uwotsi b́'imi. <verse eid="REV 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 40:34">Kesh. 40:34</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:10-11">1 Naash. 8:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13-14">2 Zen. 5:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:4">Isa. 6:4</ref> </char></note> Ik'i moonúwere Ik'i mangonat angotse keshts s'uwoon s'een b́wutsi, shawat melakiwots bodetsts shawat fayuwots s'een bowtsefetsosh konúwor Ik'i moots kindosh falraats.<verse eid="REV 15:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16"/>
  <para style="s">Ik'i fayo boyitse detsts ushi wanc'wots</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1"/>Maniyere il shawat melakiwotssh «Ameree! Ik'i fayo boyitse detsts shawat wanc'uwotsi datsats kuut'uwere!» etiru een k'aaro Ik'i mootse b́keshfere tshishi. <verse eid="REV 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 9:10">Kesh. 9:10</ref> </char></note> Melaki shintso amt wanc'man datsats kuut'b́k'ri, s'ootso milikito boatse b́ faúwotsnat s'ootso aroosh sagadiru ashuwotsats gondonat boon kúúnit gawo boats keshbwutsi.<verse eid="REV 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3"/>Melaki gitlo wanc'man aats k'araats kuut'b́k'ri, aats k'aronúwere k'irts ash s'atsok'o wotb́wtsi, aats k'armanitse beyiru kash detsts keew jamwots k'irbos'uwi.<verse eid="REV 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4"/>Melaki keezlo wanc'man fokuwotsnat aats t'úúp'uwotsats kuut'b́k'ri, boowere s'ats wotbowtsi, <verse eid="REV 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5"/>Aats k'aratse al detsts melakiyo hank'o bíetfere tbek'i, «Fa'onat teshts S'ayinono! hank'o ni angshfetsosh nee kááw neene, <verse eid="REV 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6"/>Ashuwots S'ayinwotsnat nebiyiwots s'atso bokuut'tsotse boosh s'atso ni'ishi, hanuwere boosh wotgeyike,» <verse eid="REV 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7"/>Wosh t'intseyirwonwere «Ee! jam falts doonzo Izar Izewero! ni angshfuwoots arikonat kaawne» etiru k'ááro tshishi.<verse eid="REV 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8"/>Awdl melakiyo wanc'man aawats kuut'b́k'ri, aawnwere bk'ees'on ashuwotsi bmitsish ango bish imeyi, <verse eid="REV 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9"/>ashuwotswere een k'ees'on mis'rne, jot'anotsatse al detsts Ik'o shúútso bo c'ashi, naandrone eratsne, bínowere mangiratsne.<verse eid="REV 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10"/>Utsl melakiyonwere wanc'man s'ootso k'eetsats b́ kuut'i, s'ootso mengstonúwere t'aluw wotbwtsi, ashuwots bo kic'atse tuutson bo albero bo k'eetefere bo teshi, <verse eid="REV 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11"/>bo shodonat bo gawatse tuutson daratstso Izar Izeweri boc'ashi, bo finatsnowere naandrone eratsne.<verse eid="REV 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12"/>Shrtl melakiwonwere wanc'o een foko Efrat'sats b́ kuut'i, aaw keshon weyiru naashúwotssh weerindo k'aniyosh fokitsi aatso tah b́gútsi. <verse eid="REV 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13"/>Daruwonat s'ootson nonotse, kotets nebíyo noonotsnowere gool arts keez kim shayirwots bokeshferfe t bek'i. <verse eid="REV 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14"/>Bowere adits keewo finitu Fo'eraw shayirwotsiye, shayiranotswere jam falts Izar Izewer eeno aawotssh wotit kes'osh ashuwotsi ikok ko'iyosh datsatsi nugus jamwotsok ametúne.<verse eid="REV 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:43-44">Mat. 24:43-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:30-40">Luk'. 12:30-40</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:3">Bek'. 3:3</ref> </char>
    </note> «Eshe! taa úmp'etsok'o danerawon weetwe! araatson b́ woterawok'o bí aratso ashuwots bo be'awok'o k'ande'er b́ taho kordek'et asho udeke!»<verse eid="REV 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:29">2 Naash. 23:29</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:11">Zek. 12:11</ref> </char>
    </note> Shayirwotswere nugúswotsi Ibrayist'i noon keew keewon Armagedoni eteets beyokok boko'iyi.<verse eid="REV 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17"/>Shawatl Ik' melakiyonwere s'awo jongats kuut'b́k'iri, Ik' mootse fa'a naashi jooratse «S'eenwtsere» etiru een wotts k'ááro b́ keshi. <verse eid="REV 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 8:5">Bek'. 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:13">11:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19">19</ref> </char></note> Awushp'alk'o, k'ááro, gúmi kááronat een wotts datsi shek'eyo wotb́wtsi, han arts een datsi shek'eyo asho datsatse bí azeron wot danake. <verse eid="REV 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Isa. 51:17</ref> </char></note> Een kitu keezokó bkayeyi, ash naari kitúwotswere bogaahi, Ik'o eenu Babiloni gawb́dek'i, een fayi wiyini biron s'eents wanc'o b úshetwok'owere b́ k'ali. <verse eid="REV 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 6:14">Bek'. 6:14</ref> </char></note> Aatson gúúrts datswots t'afbowtsi, guruwotsúwere daatseratsne, <verse eid="REV 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 9:23">Kesh. 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">Bek'. 11:19</ref> </char></note> Ik ikon habe úúts kilo gramiyok'o mangit shetso darotse ashuwotsats b́ oot'i, een gondbek'anwere ayidek't kic'ik b́ wottsotse ashuwots gondbek'i kic'anatse tuutson Ik'o boc'ashi.<verse eid="REV 16:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17"/>
  <para style="s">Widets mááts eenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JER 51:13">Erm. 51:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Shawt s'awwotsi detsdek't teshts shawat melakiwotsitse iko tmaants waat, taash hank'o bíeti, «Wowe! aats ayuwotsatse bedek'ts mááts een widetsuats bodet angsho neesh kitsitwe, <verse eid="REV 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 23:17">Isa. 23:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:7">Erm. 51:7</ref> </char></note> datsatsi nugúswots binton widetswotsi woterne, datsats beyirwotsu bwidi weyiniyatse dutsets biron masherne.»<verse eid="REV 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="REV 13:1">Bek'. 13:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il melakiyo shayiron woorwomaants taan dek't bíami, bíats jamo c'ashon s'eentsdek't guut'etso, shawat tookwotsnat tats k'aluwotsi detsts s'oots biraats bedek'ts máátsu tbek'i. <verse eid="REV 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 51:7">Erm. 51:7</ref> </char></note> Máátsunu hamrawi eteeyirwonat bir taho tahdek'atni btesh, awntsonat mangts shúútson ink'wotsnwoere baatswtsatni btesh, bkishaatsnowere wic'its keewonat bwidi kiimo bín s'eents awntsi wanc'o detsdek'atni btesh. <verse eid="REV 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5"/>Bbaratsnowere ááshts shúútso «widetswotsnat datsatsi kiimwots indi, Babilon eenúni» ett guut'ere b́tesh. <verse eid="REV 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6"/>Máátsman S'ayinwots s'atsonat Iyesus jango bo gawtsosh ud'etswots s'atson mashwtsaat biere tbek'i, bin tbek'tsok'on ayidek'at tiadiye. <verse eid="REV 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7"/>Melakiyonmó taash hank'o bíeti, «Eegoshe ni adiri? Máátsuko ááshtsonat bi bíyats beebdek'ts shawat tookwotsnat tats k'aluwotsi detsts s'ootsoko ááshtso neesh kish kitsitwe, <verse eid="REV 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 7:7">7:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:7">Bek'. 11:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:28">Dub. 69:28</ref> </char></note> Nbek'ts s'ootso shino teshke, and aaliye, ilowere gop' k'oolotse kááron keshetwe, t'afo maants ametuwe, datso bíazeewortson boshúútso kashi mas'afatse guut'eraw datsatse beyirwots, s'ootso shin teshke b́teshi, andi aalo ili weetwo b́wottsok'o bobek'or aditúnee.<verse eid="REV 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9"/>«Dani teleefi nib detstso b́geyituwo haniye, shawat tookwots máátsú boats b be bedek'ts shawat guruwotsiye, manotswere shawat nugúswotsiye, <verse eid="REV 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10"/>útswotswere dihirne, iko and fa'e, k'osh ikonu andoor warafa'e, bí b́woor múk' aawu s'uzsh tesho bín geyife. <verse eid="REV 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11"/>Shmtl nugúso bali teshtsonat and aalts s'ootsoniye, bí shawatwotsitse ikoniye, bít'afomantsowere ametuwe.<verse eid="REV 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:24">Dan. 7:24</ref> </char>
    </note> «Nbek'ts tats k'aluwots andoor naasheraw tats nuguswotsiye, ernmó ik sa'atosh s'ootsonton bonaashitwok'o naashi alo dek'etúne. <verse eid="REV 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13"/>Tats nugusanots ik nibo detsfne, bo boangonat bo alon s'ootsmanshe imbok'rti, <verse eid="REV 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14"/>bo mereero ats kes'o tuzitune, ernmó doonzwots doonznat nugúsuwotsatsi nugúso b́wottsotse boonda'adek'etwe, bínton fa'úwots s'eegetswotsi galdek'eetsuwotsnat amaneetswotsiye.»<verse eid="REV 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15"/>Melakiyonwere taash hank'owa bíeti, «Widetsu boats bbefere nbek'ts aatswots, ashuwotsi, jirwotsnat, k'osh k'osh naari noonon keewirwotsiye, <verse eid="REV 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16"/>s'ootsonat nbek'ts tats k'alwots widetsmani shit'etúne, binowere bt'afomaants betsitúne, araatson bin oorik'ritúne, b meetsono meetune, tawonowere mitsitúne, <verse eid="REV 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17"/>B Ik'diyo bos'eentsitwok'o hasabiyan bonibots beeztso Ik'oniye, eshe Ik'o aap'o b́s'eenfetsosh bo hasabiyon ikwotitúne, bo naashtsi alonowere s'ootsosh imk'ritune.<verse eid="REV 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18"/>«Nbek'ts máátsnwere datsatsi nuguswotsatse naashit kit eenúniye.»<verse eid="REV 17:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18"/>
  <para style="s">Babilon b dihtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1"/>Maniyere il een alo detsts k'osh melakiy iko darotse b́ oot'fere tbek'i, b́mangi golaatse tuutson datsú sháán bwtsi, <verse eid="REV 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 13:21">Isa. 13:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 21:9">21:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:39">Erm. 50:39</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:8">51:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:8">Bek'. 14:8</ref> </char></note> k'áári eenonowere hank'o ett b́kúúhi, «Eenú Babilon dihirane! dihirane! Fo'erawwots beyoko woterane! kim shayirwotssh k'eyoko woterane! kim kafwotsnat wic'its shit'its s'otswotssh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">S'ootsa: </char><char style="ft">Etirwo ik ik yoots kishon guut'ets mas'aafi biitsotse aaliye. </char></note> moo woterane! <verse eid="REV 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 23:17">Isa. 23:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:7">Erm. 51:7</ref> </char></note> B widiko weyiniyon dutsets biron mashit ash jamwotssh ishk'rerane, datsatsi nugúswotsu binton widetswotsi woterne, datsatsi jaaktswotswere beyi sheengatse tuutson galetswotsi wotwtserne.»<verse eid="REV 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 48:20">Isa. 48:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:8">Erm. 50:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:6">51:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 45">45</ref> </char>
    </note> K'osh k'aaronowere darotse hank'o b́ etfere t shishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">«Ti ashuwotso! morr finon binton ik wotk'ayere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">biyats bodet een gondbek'atse kaytswotsi wotk'ayere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">Biyokere keere!<verse eid="REV 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:20-21">Aze. 18:20-21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:9">Erm. 51:9</ref> </char>
    </note> B morri dako darots b́bodtsotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">Ik'o b gond finwotsi gawdek're,<verse eid="REV 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 137:8">Dub. 137:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:29">Erm. 50:29</ref> </char>
    </note> Bi imtsok'o betsde bish imre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">b fints finok'o git kisho bish dayere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:6">Bi k'osh k'osh úshúwotsi bi'eekts wanc'ots</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">git kisho eenshde'er bish eekk'roore,<verse eid="REV 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7"/>Bi b took mangosh beyi sheengo bi imtsok'o bodtso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">kúúnonat shiyano bish imere</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">Bi b nibon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">‹Nugúsuk'o beedek're,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">t'owu mááts taanaliye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">shiyanonwere b́ jamon tiyats boratse› etaat b ít'iri.<verse eid="REV 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8"/>Mansh biko een gond bek'jamó ik aawon biyats bodetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">K'ironat shiyanon k'ak'onwere biyats bodetúne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">tawonowere mis'etwane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">Biyats angshitwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">doonzo Izar Izewer kup'e.»<verse eid="REV 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9"/>Binton wido fintsuwotsnat beyi sheengon beyiru datsatsi nugúsuwots bi b mis'or keshet s'uwo bobek'or b jangosh kuhar bo eepeti, <verse eid="REV 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9-10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 26:16-17">Hzk'. 26:16-17</ref> </char></note> b kúúno sharr wokoon need'de'er «Nee een kitune, nee kup' kitu Babilone! ni angsho ik sa'atotse niyats b́ waatsotse, indowe neesha!» bo etiri.<verse eid="REV 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EZK 27:31-36">Hzk'. 27:31-36</ref> </char>
    </note> Bo jaaki k'ac'o haniyak boatse keewitwo bí altsotse datsatsi jaktswots bish eepetune, shiyanitune, <verse eid="REV 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12"/>Bo markabats kuriyets awntso, ambaro, mangts shútso, ink'uwo, tahi sheengo, hamrawiya eteef arts taho, hariyon wozets taho, tahi bironat shak' shaaw wotts mit jamo, dangesh gásho, k'awnts shaaw kishf mitatse dozets jamó, k'áázo, bíronat shenon dozets k'ac' jamo, <verse eid="REV 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12-13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 27:12-13">Hzk'. 27:12-13</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 27:22">22</ref> </char></note> k'erafa, k'memiyo, kerbeya eteetso, it'ano, woyoniyon dutsets biro, woyira eteets miti zeyito, buudo, sndeyo, minzwotsi, mererwotsi, farshwotsi, seregelo, guutswotsnat k'osh ashuwotsiye <verse eid="REV 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14"/>Bowere «Nee n tewnts sheeng keew jamwots niyatsere wokat k'az amrne, n gaalonu n s'ilalonú b́ jamon t'afwtsere, haniyako jamanots b́jamon daatsratsne!» etetúne biisha. <verse eid="REV 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 27:31">Hzk'. 27:31</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36">36</ref> </char></note> Jamkeewanotsi keewedek't galetswotsi wotts jaktswots b kúúnman sharr wokoon need'itúne, eefr shiyaanefetsrnwere, <verse eid="REV 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16"/>«Tahi sheengonat bí aro hamrawi wotts tahi bironowere tahef teshtsu, awntsonat mangts shútsono, ink'uwon baatsf teshtsu, een kitush indowe biisha! indowe biisha! <verse eid="REV 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 23:14">Isa. 23:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:26-30">Hzk'. 27:26-30</ref> </char></note> mank'o bodts gaalo ik sa'atutse t'af b́wtsi!» etetúne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Markabutse aliru jamwots, markabon sha'iru ash jamwots, markabatse finiru jamo, aats k'aratse jaakiru jamo wokoon need'wtsitúne, <verse eid="REV 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 27:32">Hzk'. 27:32</ref> </char></note> Bi b mis'or keshet s'úwo bobek'tsok'on, «Kit eenani arts kito k'osh kito b́jamon fa'a b́teshi?» ett bokuhi. <verse eid="REV 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 27:30-34">Hzk'. 27:30-34</ref> </char></note> Botookats k'úndo kishfetst, eepfetst, shiyaanefetsr hank'o erfetsr kuuhitúne, «Aats k'aratse markabwotsi detsts jamwots b gaalon galetswotsi bowoti, kit eenman ik sa'atutse di'ebwtstsotse indowe biisha! indowe biisha!» <verse eid="REV 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20"/>Darono! biyatse tuutson gene'owe! Ik'o it ats bfiintsatse tuutson biyatsats bí angshtsotse it S'ayinwotsnat wosheetswotsu nebiywotswere gene'úwore!<verse eid="REV 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JER 51:63-64">Erm. 51:63-64</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:21">Hzk'. 26:21</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il melaki kup' iko di'i shútsi eenok'o bodts shúts iko k'aaúdek't hank'o err aats k'aromaants shap'etwe «Een kitu Babilon hank'o angnon gifneyar dihitwaniye, haniyakowere b́ jamon daatseratsane, <verse eid="REV 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 26:13">Hzk'. 26:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 24:8">Isa. 24:8</ref> </char></note> begena eteetso t'imbok'o t'imbirwotsnat duubi k'ááro, turaro fugirwatsnat gaato fugfuwots k'ááro, aani gitlo niyoke shisheratse, kon naari kishi danon finitu dani telefetso haniyak niyoke daatseratse, di'shútsi k'ááronwere aani niyoke shisheratse. <verse eid="REV 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22-23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Erm. 7:34</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:10">25:10</ref> </char></note> C'eeshi shááno haniyak niyatse c'esheratse, guyonat guyu k'ááro haniyakon niyoke shisheratse, jaakiru nikwotsu datsatsi ash een eenwotsiye boteshi, ni atono ashuwotsi darirne.»<verse eid="REV 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:24 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JER 51:49">Erm. 51:49</ref> </char>
    </note> «Biitsnowere nebiyotsnat S'ayinwots, datsatse ud'etswots ash jami s'atso daatsere.»<verse eid="REV 18:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1"/>Haniyere okoon hank'o etiru ayi ash k'aar artsok'o een wotts k'ááro darotse tshishi «Haleluya!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Haleluya: </char><char style="ft">Eto Ibrayist'iy noon keewon «Ik'o udewe» etee. </char></note> kashiyonat mangon angonwere no Ik'o Izar Izewerke! <verse eid="REV 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Iwi. 32:43</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:7">2 Naash. 9:7</ref> </char></note> Bí angshonwere arik wotat kááwe, datsu b widon kimshtsu een wotts widetsu angsht bin fayere, bin fayatnwere b́ guutswots weero wershre.» <verse eid="REV 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 34:10">Isa. 34:10</ref> </char></note> Aaninwere, «Haleluya! biyitsere keshiru s'úwo dúre dúrosh dambaan keshetwe!» etniye bokuhiri. <verse eid="REV 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4"/>Hiye awd eenashuwotsnat awd azeets kashetswotswere naashi jooratse beyiru Ik'o Izar Izewersh bobaron gúp'gúp'at «Amen haleluya!» ett bosagadi.<verse eid="REV 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mereero móónat ushok s'eegetswots</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 115:13">Dub. 115:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Haniyakon «Bín shatiru b́ guuts jamwotso, k'ac'nwotsu een eenwotsu Izar Izeweri udoore!» etirwo naashi joorotse b́ keshi. <verse eid="REV 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 1:24">Hzk'. 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 93:1">Dub. 93:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:1">97:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 99:1">99:1</ref> </char></note> Ay ashuwots k'ááro wos'iru aats k'arok'o, kúp' wotts guumi k'arok'o artso hank'o bí eree tshishi, «Haleluya! jam faltso no doonzo Izar Izewer naashitwe! <verse eid="REV 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7"/>Mereero jiwo b́ bodtsotse b́ guuyúnwere k'anbdek'tsotse woore gene'owone! gene'o woshwone! bínowere mangiwone! <verse eid="REV 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8"/>Golirwonat s'ayin taho b tahitwok'o bish imk'rere, tahanwere S'ayinwots kááw finoniye.»<verse eid="REV 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="REV 22:2-3">22:2-3</ref> </char>
    </note> Haniyak melakiyo «Mereero jiwoki móónat ushok s'eegetswots derekne» err guud'e bí eti, manats dabtnwere «Ik'o aap'anots arikeewwotsiye» bí eti.<verse eid="REV 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10"/>Taawere sagadosh melakiyo tufishirots t baron t gup' gup'i, ernmó «K'aye! han k'alk'aye! taawere neenat Iyesussh gawo detsts ni eshuwotsnton guuts taane, Ik'osh sagadowe! ari bek' jamo Iyesus jangoshe b́gawefoni» bíeti taasha.<verse eid="REV 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nas' farshi abaats bedek'ts asho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:1">Hzk'. 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:13">Dub. 96:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:4">Isa. 11:4</ref> </char>
    </note> Hniyere okoon daro b́ k'eshere t bek'i, mann nas' farsho t bek'i, farshmanatsnowere bedek'ts amanetsonat arika etetsoniye, bíwere kááwon angshitwe, kááwono kaaritwe, <verse eid="REV 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 10:6">Dan. 10:6</ref> </char></note> Bí ááwwots tawi laluwe boari, b́ tookatsnowere ay zewdiyots fa'ane, bíyere okoon konúwor b́ danaw bíyats guut'ets shúútso fa'e b́teshi, <verse eid="REV 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13"/>bíwere s'atson gupets taho tahdek'ke b́ teshi, b́ shúútsonwere «Ik' aap'a» eteeke. <verse eid="REV 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14"/>Nas' farshwotsats beedek'tswots, nas'onat s'ayin taho tahdek'ts daratsi jirwots b́jafrats botuwi, <verse eid="REV 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Dub. 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:3">Isa. 63:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 3:13">Iyo. 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:20">Bek'. 14:20</ref> </char></note> ash naarwotsi bín b́ togetwo shiki goradi shasho b́ nonotsne b́ keshiri, bírri gumbonowere boon keewitwe, bíwere jam falts Ik'o fay shatiitso kitsit weyini biro fis'efook'o net'eetwe, <verse eid="REV 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16"/>b́ tahonat b́ shokatse «Nugúswotsatsi nugúso doonzwots doonzo» etiru shúútso guut'ere.<verse eid="REV 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17"/>Maniyere il aawats need'dek'ts melaki iko t bek'i, bíwere daaratse bidiru kafuwotssh hank'o ett een k'aaron b́kuuhi, «Een wotts Ik' móónat ushok woore! ko'ewere! <verse eid="REV 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18"/>nugúsuwots meetso, kes' jishirwots meetso, kúp kes'etswots meetso, farshetswotsnat farshwotsn meetso, guuts woterawwotsnat guutswots meetso, k'ac'nwotsnat een eenwots meetso, wáár moore.»<verse eid="REV 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19"/>Mank'o s'ootsonat datsatsi nugúswotsn, boosh kes'fwotswere nas' farshatse beedek'tsonat bísh kes'f jirwotsnton kaarosh ikok boko'ere t bek'i, <verse eid="REV 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 13:1-8">Bek'. 13:1-8</ref> </char></note> ernmó s'ootso b́ deetseyi, bíntonwere b́ shinatse ayi adits keewwotsi finiru kootets nebiyo b́ deetseyi, bíwere s'ootso milikito detstswotsnat s'ootsman artsosh sagadat teshtswotsi adits keewo finat b́ sheelifwotsi, gitanots kashon bo befere dini k'arots bo juweyi. <verse eid="REV 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21"/>Oortswotsu nas' farshatse beyirwo nonotse keshiru shiki goradon boúd'eyi, kaf jamwots bo meetso maat bowori.<verse eid="REV 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20"/>
  <para style="s">Ik kúm nati mengsto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1"/>Haniyere il dashan aydek't gop'ts gop'o bín k'esheefonat habili eeno b́ kishatse detsdek'ts melakiyo darotse b́ oot'fere tbek'i, <verse eid="REV 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Aze. 3:1</ref> </char></note> daruwonowere detsdek't ik kum natosh tip b́k'ri, daruwaanwere Diyabilosi wee Shed'anman shints dawunzoniye, <verse eid="REV 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3"/>kúm nato b́ s'uufetsosh ashuwotsi b́darirawok'o melakiman daruman ayidek't dashan gop'ts gop'ots juub́k'ri, is'on is'k'rat matabo bíyats jot'b́k'ri, maniyere il múk'na'a gizewosh b́biitsewo bísh geyife.<verse eid="REV 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:9-22">Dan. 7:9-22</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il naashi joorwotsi tbek'i, naashi jooratsnwere angshosh alo boosh imeetswots bobefere tbek'i, Iyesus jangosh bogawtsanat Ik'i aap'atse tuutson botoko boatse k'ut'ets kashwotsi tbek'i, bohe s'ootsoshowere b́ doozts armansh sagaderatsne, b́ milikitonowere bo barats wotowa bokishats ged de'aawwotsiye, bo k'irotse tuut Krstosnton ik kum natosh bo naashi. <verse eid="REV 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5"/>K'irts k'oshwotsmó ik kum nato b́s'uufetsosh k'irotse tuuratsne, hanwere k'irotse tuu shintsoniye, <verse eid="REV 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6"/>K'irotse tuu shintsotse bano detstswots deeretswotsnat S'ayinwotsiye, gitl k'iro boatse alo deshatse, bohe Ik'onat Krstos kahniwotsi wotitune, Krstosntonwere ik kum nato naashitúne.<verse eid="REV 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shed'ano bda'e da'ewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7"/>Kum natman b́s'uwiyakoon Shed'ano b́tipets tipotse biishitwe, <verse eid="REV 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 7:2">Hzk'. 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:2">38:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 38:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 15">15</ref> </char></note> datsjamatse fa'a ashuwotsi boowere Gognat Mangogn dariyosh kes'osho de'e keshetwe, botaawonwere aats k'ari gúúratse fa'a shiyok'oyiye, <verse eid="REV 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9"/>bo dats jamats bad'ts S'ayinwots gálunat shuneets kitu gúúrbodek'i, wotowa eree tawo darotse oot't boon mitsdek't t'afib́k'ri. <verse eid="REV 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10"/>Boon sheelitso Diyablos, s'ootsonat kootets nebiyo, bobeyirwoki dini taw k'arots juweb́wtsi, manoknowere t'úwonat aawon dúre dúrosh bo kúúneti.<verse eid="REV 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwori angsho imetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11"/>Maniye il een naashi joor nas' ikonat naashi joormnats beedek'tso t bek'i, datsonat daron b́shinaatse k'az bowos'i, boosh beyoko daatseratse, <verse eid="REV 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11-12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:9-10">Dan. 7:9-10</ref> </char></note> k'irts muk'nanúwotsnat een eenwotsn naashi jorman shinatse boned'efere tbek'i, mas'aafwotswere bok'esheyi, kashi mas'aaf wottso k'oshonwere b́k'esheyi, k'irtswotswere mas'afmanotsitse guut'etso bofiinok'on bo angsho bodek'i, <verse eid="REV 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13"/>aats k'aaronúwere b́gitsotse fa'a k'irtswotsi b́imi, k'ironat Si'olwere bogitsotse teshts k'irtswotsi boimi, ashonwere ik ikon b́ fints finok'on b́ angsho b́dek'i. <verse eid="REV 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14"/>K'ironat Si'olwere tawi k'arots bojuweyi, tawi k'araanúwere gitl k'ironiye, <verse eid="REV 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15"/>b́ shúútso kash mas'aafats guut'eyat daatseraw jamo tawi k'arots b́juweyi.<verse eid="REV 20:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21"/>
  <para style="s">Handr daronat handr datson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:17">Isa. 65:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:22">66:22</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:13">2 P'et'. 3:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il handr daronat handr datson tbek'i, dar shintsonat shints datsun besherno botesh, aats k'aaronúwere beeratse. <verse eid="REV 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Isa. 52:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:10">61:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:12">Bek'. 3:12</ref> </char></note> Kit S'ayinú, Iyerusalem handru, b kenihsh baatsts guuyukok'o k'andek'at darotse Ik'oke b oot'fere tbek'i, <verse eid="REV 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 37:27">Hzk'. 37:27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:11-12">Lew. 26:11-12</ref> </char></note> hank'o etiru k'áári eenonowere naashi jooratse b́ keshfere t shishi, «Hambe! Ik'i k'ewoko ashuwots dagotse, bontonwere beetwe, boowere bíashuwotsi wotitúne, Ik'o b́tookon bonton wotitwe, Izar Izewerwere bok wotitwe, <verse eid="REV 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4"/>bo aawatse aac'ú jamo firitwe, shints niwo b́beshtsotse wee k'iro wee shiyano wee eepo wee kúúno haniyak beeratse.»<verse eid="REV 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5"/>Naashi jooratse bedek'tsonwere «Hamb! taa jam keewo handr woshitwe!» bíeti, manats dab́tnwere, «Aap'ets aap'an amanetsonat arik b́wottsotse guud'e» bíeti taasha. <verse eid="REV 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa. 55:1</ref> </char></note> Maniyere il taash hank'o bí'eti, «Wotwtsere! Alfonat Omego, shintsonat s'uwatstso taane, shashutsosh kash t'úúp'iru aatsotse ik k'awuntsalo beenon bísh imetwe, <verse eid="REV 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam. 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:26-27">Dub. 89:26-27</ref> </char></note> da'adek'etwo han naatetwe, taa bí Ik'o Izar Izeweri wotitwe, bíwere t naayi wotitwe, <verse eid="REV 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8"/>ernmó shatetswots, imnetiyo deshawwots, kiimwots, kash úd'tswots, widetswots, atetswots, woteraw ik'uwotsi Ik'irwots, kootets jamwots boko boon kotirúwo dini k'arotse bowotiti, manúwere gitl k'ironiye.»<verse eid="REV 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyerusalem handru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9"/>S'uwaatsi shawat faywots bín bos'eents shawat wanc'wotsi detsdek'ts melaki shawatwotsitse iko waat «Wowe! mereero mááts guyu neesh kitsuna» bí eti. <verse eid="REV 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 40:2">Hzk'. 40:2</ref> </char></note> Shayiron taan een geenz gur ikok dek' amt kit S'ayinú Iyerusalem Ik'oke darotse b oot'fere taash b́ kitsi, <verse eid="REV 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11"/>Ik'i mangon bc'eeshfera btesh, b shááni golonúwere ayidek't mangts shútsok'oyi, mestayitok'o goliru yasp'idiya eteets mangts shútsok'oyi b́teshi, <verse eid="REV 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12"/>tatse git fengeshwotsi detsts eenonat geenz gmbi kas'o detsfa btesh, tatse git fengeshwotsoknowere tatse git melakiwots need'dek'tni bokotfere botesh, bofengeshatsnowere Isra'el jir tatse gitwots shúútswots guut'eyatni botesh. <verse eid="REV 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12-13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 48:30-35">Hzk'. 48:30-35</ref> </char></note> Aaw keshon keez fengeshwots, gaar kawon keez fengeshwots, muur kááwon keez fengeshwots, aaw kindon keez fengeshwots fa'ano botesh. <verse eid="REV 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14"/>Kitman gmbi kas'o b́ned'ok tatse git shutswotsi detsfe b́tesh, b́ned'ok manotsatsnowere tatse git mereero woshetsúwots shúútso guut'ere b́teshi, <verse eid="REV 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 40:3">Hzk'. 40:3</ref> </char></note> taash keewts melakiyonúwere kitunat bfengeshwotsn, gmbi kas'onowere bín b́ indit awntsi gumbo detsfe b́tesh, <verse eid="REV 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16"/>Kitu geenzonat gawnonúwere taal wottso awd tungúsho detski bteshi, melakiyo kitu bín indeyiru guumbmann indat bíere bgeenzo git kumonat awd bal kilometrok'o<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Git kumonat awd bal kilometrok'o: </char><char style="ft">Eto Grikiyon 12 kúm stadiya etee, man etonu ik stadiyo gitbalosh tats shap metree. </char></note> b́woti, bgawnonat bneed'onúwere mank'oyiye b́woti, <verse eid="REV 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17"/>Melakiyo gmbiyi kas'man need'o b́ indi, melakiyo ash kishi indok'o bodts b́indon b́indere b́ nuutso bale habe awd indok'o b́woti, <verse eid="REV 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18-21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 54:11-12">Isa. 54:11-12</ref> </char></note> gmbiyonúwere bíage Iyasp'idiya eteets shútsona b́tesh, kitmanwere mastayitok'o s'aynts awntsi s'ayinon ageeki btesh, <verse eid="REV 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19"/>kitu gmbi kas'o b́ned'oko k'osh k'osh naari k'awntsi shaawon keewets shútson baatskno botesh, biyats b need'ok shintso Iyasp'idiya eteef shútsoni b́tesh, gitlonwere Senperiya eteefoni, keezlonúwere Kelk'edoniya eteeka, awdlonúwere meregediya, <verse eid="REV 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20"/>útslonúwere Serdonkesiya, shrtlo Serdiyoniya, shawatlo Krstlobeya, shmtlo Bilila, jeed'lo wurawure, tatslo Krsp'rassi, tatse iklo Yanktiya, tatse gitlo Ametest'isnosiya etefuwotsi botesh. <verse eid="REV 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21"/>Tatse git fengeshwotswere tatse git ink'wotsi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:21 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ink'uwa: </char><char style="ft">Ink'wo aats k'arotse beef k'ot'ik'olo bígtsots shiyo b́kindor shiyman bín b́k'oawok'o bíatsotse ilac'ok'o kishde'er shiyman bín b́k'oawok'o shiy man bin bi ipef goiliru keewatsna bíazefo, manwere ink'wo b́wotiti. </char></note> botesh, fengeshwots ik ikon ik ink'won fiineka botesh, kitu weronúwere mastayitok'o shááno beshiyiru s'ayin awntson doozeka b́tesh.<verse eid="REV 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22"/>Jam falts doonzo Izar Izewernat mereeron b S'ayin maa bowottsotse kitutse S'ayin moo be'atse, <verse eid="REV 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 60:19-20">Isa. 60:19-20</ref> </char></note> Ik'i mango bish b́ c'eeshitwotsenat mereronu b c'eesho b́wottsotse kitmansh aawo wee aashitso bish b́c'esho geyiratse. <verse eid="REV 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 60:3">Isa. 60:3</ref> </char></note> Ashuwots bsháánon anaanitúne, datsatsi naashwotswere bomango bmaants dowetúne, <verse eid="REV 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25"/>Kitaniitse t'úwo bíaaltsotse bfengshwots jam aawon is'erakne. <verse eid="REV 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25-26</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 60:11">Isa. 60:11</ref> </char></note> Mengstwots een shúútsonat mangon biyits kinditune, <verse eid="REV 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Isa. 52:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 44:9">Hzk'. 44:9</ref> </char></note> wic'its keewo b́ jamon bits kindratse, kim fin finirwonat kooto keewirwo b́jamon bits kindratse, bits kinditwots bo shúútso mereero kashi mas'aafats guut'etswots s'uziye.<verse eid="REV 21:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EZK 47:1">Hzk'. 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zek. 14:8</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il melakiyo Ik'onat mereero naashi joorotse keshiru mastayiti s'ayinok'o golirwo kash imts aatsi foko taash b́kitsi, <verse eid="REV 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Aze. 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 47:12">Hzk'. 47:12</ref> </char></note> fokaan kitutsi een een werindwotsi taalon kap'de'er beshitwe, fokman giromaantsonat k'aniweeron shaash shaashon shuufetst worwotootse tatse gitoto shuwo imet kashi mito fa'e b́teshi, mitman maarwotswere ash kashiykno. <verse eid="REV 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 14:11">14:11</ref> </char></note> Haniyere okonowere kon naari c'asho aaliye, Ik'onat mereeron naashi jooro kit manits wotituwe, b́ guutswotswere bín ik'itune. <verse eid="REV 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4"/>B́ shitsono bek'etúnee, b́ shúútsonwere bo barats wotitwe. <verse eid="REV 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 60:19">Isa. 60:19</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:18">Dan. 7:18</ref> </char></note> Haniyere okoon t'úwo beeratse, doonzo Izar Izewer boosh b́ sháánitwotse, aaw golo wee c'eeshi shááno boosh geyiratse, dúre dúrosh naashitúne.<verse eid="REV 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus aanar b́weetwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6"/>Maniyere il melakiyo taash hank'owa bíet, «Aap'ets aap'anots amanetswotsnat arikwotsiye, nebiyiwotssh shayir imiru doonzo Izar Izewer karnon wotitwo b́ guutsuwotssh kitsosh b́ melakiyo b́ woshi.»<verse eid="REV 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7"/>Iyesuswere «Hamb eshe! taa káári weetwe! mas'aafanitsi bek'on aap'ets aap'o kordek'etwo deereke!» bí eti.<verse eid="REV 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8"/>Keewanotsi shishtsonat bek'tsoon taane Yohansiye, keewanotsi t shishtsok'onat tbek'tsok'on hanotsi taash kitsts melakiwosh sagadosh b́tufishirots tdihi. <verse eid="REV 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9"/>Melakiyonmó «K'aye han k'alk'aye! taa neenat mas'aafanitsi aap'wotsi s'eentsiru nebiyi eshuwwotsnton guuts taane, Ik'osh sagadowe!» bí eti. <verse eid="REV 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10"/>Manats dabt taash hank'o bíeti, «Dúro karnk b́wottsotse mas'aafanitsi bek'on aap'etso matabon is'k'aye, <verse eid="REV 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 12:10">Dan. 12:10</ref> </char></note> Haniyak weer gondonu b́ weeri gondo need'ik'aye, kiimonúwere kiime, kááwonwere kááwowe, S'ayinonwere S'ayine.»<verse eid="REV 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:10">Isa. 40:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:11">62:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:4">28:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Erm. 17:10</ref> </char>
    </note> «Eshe taa káári weeetwe! ik ikosh b́ finok'o bísh t imet k'awntso detsdek're, <verse eid="REV 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 1:8">Bek'. 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="REV 1:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:8">2:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:6">Isa. 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48:12</ref> </char></note> Alfonat Omegon, shinaatstsonat shuutstson, shintsonat s'uwatstso taane.»<verse eid="REV 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:9">Aze. 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:22">3:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Kash imiru mitu shuwo máár bfengeshonowere kituts kindosh bofalitwok'o bo taho mashdek'tswots derekne. <verse eid="REV 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15"/>Kanok'o jamkeewo kiimshirwots, atetswots, widetswots, kash úd'tswots, woteraw ik' ik'iruwots, koot shuntswotsnat kooti weeron sha'iru jamwots kitmaniyere úre bowotiti.<verse eid="REV 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa. 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10">10</ref> </char>
    </note> «Taa Iyesus gawan boosh b́ imetwok'o t melakiyo Ik'i moowwotssh woshere, taa Dawit s'oot'i s'ap'taane, c'eeshiru datsigatsi mozofo taane.»<verse eid="REV 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa. 55:1</ref> </char>
    </note> S'ayin shayironat guuyun «Wowe!» etirune, shishirwonwere «Wowe!» eree, shashutso wowe, b́ geets kash imet aatso k'awntsalo hank'on úyee.<verse eid="REV 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18"/>Hamb mas'afanitsere guut'ets bek'on aap'o shishetu jamo bí atso korb́dek'etwok'owa etirwe, konwor aap'anatse ik keewo b́ dabiyal mas'afanitsere guut'ets fayuwotsi Ik'o bíyats dabitwe. <verse eid="REV 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18-19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 4:2">Iwi. 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:32">12:32</ref> </char></note> Konworu bek'i mas'afanits guut'etswotsitse ik keewo b́ shapiyal, mas'afanitsitse keewets kash imet mit shuwonat S'ayin kitutsere Ik'o b́ bano shapitwe.<verse eid="REV 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20"/>Keewanotssh gaw wottso «Arikon káári weetwe!» etfe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Amen, doonzo Iyesuso wowe!<verse eid="REV 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21"/>Doonzo Iyesus s'aato it únetsnton wotowe.<verse eid="REV 22:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22"/>
</usx>
